"Try a shorter word or a different setting name." = "试试更短的关键词，或换一个设置名称。";

"Choosing a profile from the “Profiles” menu opens a new window.\nYou must restart Latterm after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "从“配置方案”菜单打开新窗口。\n更改后需重启 Latterm。";
"Select the tab to the left when closing a tab?\nIf disabled, the tab to the right of the closing tab will be selected." = "关闭标签页后选中左侧标签页。\n关闭此选项时选中右侧标签页。";
"How long in seconds to show tabs in fullscreen.\nThe tab bar appears briefly in fullscreen when the number of tabs changes or you switch tabs. This setting gives the time in seconds for it to remain visible." = "全屏时临时显示标签栏的时长（秒）。\n切换标签页或标签页数量变化时，标签栏会短暂出现。";
"How long in seconds to show tabs in fullscreen." = "全屏时临时显示标签栏的时长（秒）。";
"How far must the mouse move before a tab drag is initiated?\nYou must restart Latterm after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "开始拖动标签页所需的最小鼠标移动距离。\n更改后需重启 Latterm。";
"Use “smart truncation” for tab titles.\nIf a tab‘s title is too long to fit, ellipsize the start of the title if more tabs have unique suffixes than prefixes in a given window." = "智能截断标签页标题。\n标题过长且后缀比前缀更容易区分时，省略标题开头。";
"Use “smart truncation” for tab titles." = "智能截断标签页标题。";
"How prominent should the outline around the selected tab be drawn when there are colored tabs in a window?\nTakes a value in 0 to 3, where 0 means no outline and 3 means a very prominent outline." = "彩色标签页中选中标签页的轮廓强度。\n范围为 0–3；0 为不显示，3 为最明显。";
"How prominent should the outline around the selected tab be drawn when there are colored tabs in a window?" = "彩色标签页中选中标签页的轮廓强度。";
"In the Minimal theme, you can move the window by dragging starting in a region on the edge near the window border. This gives the size of that region." = "极简主题中用于拖动窗口的边缘区域大小。";
"In the Compact theme, you can move the window by dragging starting in a region on the edge near the window border. This gives the size of that region." = "紧凑主题中用于拖动窗口的边缘区域大小。";
"In the Minimal theme, how different should the background color of the selected tab be from the others?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is no difference and 1 very different." = "极简主题中选中标签页与其他标签页的背景色差异。\n范围为 0–1；0 为无差异，1 为差异最大。";
"In the Minimal theme, how different should the background color of the selected tab be from the others?" = "极简主题中选中标签页与其他标签页的背景色差异。";
"In the Minimal theme, how prominent should the tab outline be?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is invisible and 1 is very prominent" = "极简主题的标签页轮廓强度。\n范围为 0–1；0 为不可见，1 为最明显。";
"In the Minimal theme, how prominent should the tab outline be?" = "极简主题的标签页轮廓强度。";
"In the Minimal theme, how prominent should split pane dividers be?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is invisible and 1 is very prominent" = "极简主题的分屏分隔线强度。\n范围为 0–1；0 为不可见，1 为最明显。";
"In the Minimal theme, how prominent should split pane dividers be?" = "极简主题的分屏分隔线强度。";
"How prominent should the text in a non-selected tab be when there are colored tabs in a window?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, the alpha value." = "彩色标签页中未选中标签页的文字不透明度。\n范围为 0–1。";
"How prominent should the text in a non-selected tab be when there are colored tabs in a window?" = "彩色标签页中未选中标签页的文字不透明度。";
"How much should contrast be increased for text in tabs in the Minimal theme?\nChoose a value larger than 1 to increase contrast. Values between 0 and 1 have less contrast than the default." = "极简主题的标签文字对比度倍率。\n大于 1 提高对比度，0–1 降低对比度。";
"How much should contrast be increased for text in tabs in the Minimal theme?" = "极简主题的标签文字对比度倍率。";
"In the Minimal theme, should the area left of the tab bar be treated as part of the first tab?" = "极简主题中将标签栏左侧留白视为首个标签页的一部分。";
"Tab bar height (points) for the Minimal theme.\nThe default is 38. Use 22 to match the compact theme's height." = "极简主题的标签栏高度（点）。\n默认为 38；设为 22 可与紧凑主题一致。";
"Tab bar height (points) for the Minimal theme." = "极简主题的标签栏高度（点）。";
"Minimum width for tab labels.\nThe activity/bell icon will be hidden when the space for the label drops below this size (in points)" = "标签页文字区域的最小宽度（点）。\n小于此宽度时隐藏活动和响铃图标。";
"Minimum width for tab labels." = "标签页文字区域的最小宽度（点）。";
"Ignore System Settings > Dock > Prefer tabs when opening documents?\nWhen set to No, asking to open a window will open a tab instead when system settings is configured to prefer tabs over windows. When set to Yes, asking to open a window may open a tab instead." = "忽略系统的“打开文稿时首选标签页”设置。\n关闭时，创建窗口会遵循系统对标签页的偏好。";
"Ignore System Settings > Dock > Prefer tabs when opening documents?" = "忽略系统的“打开文稿时首选标签页”设置。";
"In the Minimal and Compact themes when there is a single tab and the tab bar is visible, should dragging the tab bar move the window?\nThis also affects windows without titlebars in any theme." = "极简和紧凑主题中，只有一个标签页时拖动标签栏可移动窗口。\n也适用于所有主题下没有标题栏的窗口。";
"In the Minimal and Compact themes when there is a single tab and the tab bar is visible, should dragging the tab bar move the window?" = "极简和紧凑主题中，只有一个标签页时拖动标签栏可移动窗口。";
"High Contrast modes maximize visibility.\nWhen enabled, the dark high-contrast theme emphasizes visibility over beauty." = "高对比度模式优先确保可见性。\n启用后，深色高对比度主题优先保证辨识度。";
"High Contrast modes maximize visibility." = "高对比度模式优先确保可见性。";
"Use custom font size for tab labels?\nSee also advanced setting “Custom tab label font size”." = "为标签页文字使用自定义字号。\n字号由“标签页文字的自定义字号”设置控制。";
"Custom tab label font size\nFor this to take effect, turn on “Use custom font size for tab labels?”." = "标签页文字的自定义字号。\n需同时启用“为标签页文字使用自定义字号”。";
"Prominence of selected tab underline indicator in the Minimal theme when there is at least one colored tab." = "极简主题中选中标签页下划线的强度。";
"Allow two-finger interactive swipe between tabs?\nThe system preference Trackpad > More Gestures > Swipe between pages controls this globally. When “swipe with two fingers” is enabled, you can change this setting to “No” to prevent swiping between tabs in Latterm." = "允许双指滑动切换标签页。\n需在系统的触控板设置中启用双指翻页；关闭此选项可仅在 Latterm 中禁用。";
"Allow two-finger interactive swipe between tabs?" = "允许双指滑动切换标签页。";
"Select tabs on mouse-down?\nChanging this setting will not affect existing windows." = "按下鼠标时立即选中标签页。\n更改不影响已打开的窗口。";
"Alpha value for tab color for non-selected colored tabs in the Minimal theme.\nMust be between 0 and 1." = "极简主题中未选中彩色标签页的不透明度。\n范围为 0–1。";
"Alpha value for tab color for non-selected colored tabs in the Minimal theme." = "极简主题中未选中彩色标签页的不透明度。";
"Colors for tab color menu item.\nSpace delimited strings like #rrggbb or #rgb in sRGB color space. If the P3 color space is available, you can use strings like: color(p3 1 0.5 0.25)" = "标签页颜色菜单中的颜色。\n使用空格分隔的 sRGB 值，如 #rrggbb 或 #rgb；支持 P3 时也可使用 color(p3 1 0.5 0.25)。";
"Colors for tab color menu item." = "标签页颜色菜单中的颜色。";
"Remove the “new tab” button from horizontal tab bars?" = "隐藏水平标签栏中的新建标签页按钮。";
"Should the “new tab” button in the tab bar use the current session’s profile?\nWhen enabled, clicking the “+” button opens a new tab with the current session’s profile instead of the default profile." = "新建标签页按钮使用当前会话的配置方案。\n关闭时使用默认配置方案。";
"Should the “new tab” button in the tab bar use the current session’s profile?" = "新建标签页按钮使用当前会话的配置方案。";
"Darkness (in [0…1]) for non-selected tabs in non-Minimal theme in light mode." = "浅色模式下未选中标签页的暗度。";
"Darkness (in [0…1]) for non-selected tabs in non-Minimal theme in dark mode." = "深色模式下未选中标签页的暗度。";
"Place the tabbar in the window's titlebar in full screen mode (macOS 13+ only)?\nThis can be disabled to work around a bug in macOS where tabs may not be visible in full screen." = "全屏时将标签栏放入窗口标题栏（macOS 13 及以上）。\n遇到全屏标签栏消失的系统问题时可关闭。";
"Place the tabbar in the window's titlebar in full screen mode (macOS 13+ only)?" = "全屏时将标签栏放入窗口标题栏（macOS 13 及以上）。";
"Use the running command's first letter as the tab's default icon if there isn't a built in one.\nThis takes effect when tabs are configured to use built-in icons." = "没有内置图标时，使用运行中命令的首字母作为标签页图标。\n仅在标签页使用内置图标时生效。";
"Use the running command's first letter as the tab's default icon if there isn't a built in one." = "没有内置图标时，使用运行中命令的首字母作为标签页图标。";
"Should tab close buttons always remain visible?" = "始终显示标签页关闭按钮。";
"Use Sequoia-style tabs in Tahoe and later?" = "在 Tahoe 及更新系统中使用 Sequoia 风格的标签页。";
"Scroll wheel sends arrow keys when in alternate screen mode." = "备用屏幕模式下滚轮发送方向键。";
"Disable changing font size in response to a pinch gesture." = "禁用捏合手势调整字号。";
"Use system cursor icons when possible." = "尽可能使用系统光标图标。";
"Always accept first mouse event on terminal windows.\nThis means clicks will work the same when Latterm is active as when it’s inactive. Note that there is a separate setting for mouse reporting on first mouse." = "终端窗口始终响应首次鼠标点击。\n应用未激活时也会执行点击操作；首次点击的鼠标报告由单独选项控制。";
"Always accept first mouse event on terminal windows." = "终端窗口始终响应首次鼠标点击。";
"Automatically detect when mouse reporting got stuck on?\nThis watches for parts of mouse reporting control sequences being printed to the screen" = "自动检测鼠标报告是否卡在开启状态。\n检测屏幕上意外输出的鼠标报告控制序列片段。";
"Automatically detect when mouse reporting got stuck on?" = "自动检测鼠标报告是否卡在开启状态。";
"Send mouse reports when you click in a window that isn't already frontmouse?" = "点击尚未获得鼠标焦点的窗口时发送鼠标报告。";
"Double-report scroll wheel events to work around tmux scrolling bug." = "重复发送滚轮报告以绕过 tmux 的滚动问题。";
"When Focus Follows Mouse is enabled, steal key focus even when inactive." = "焦点跟随鼠标时，即使应用未激活也获取键盘焦点。";
"When Focus Follows Mouse is enabled, activate the window under the cursor when Latterm becomes active?" = "启用焦点跟随鼠标时，激活 Latterm 会聚焦鼠标下的窗口。";
"⌘-click in an active pane while Latterm isn't the active app invokes Semantic History.\nBy default, Latterm respects the OS standard that ⌘-click in an app that doesn't have keyboard focus behaves like a non-⌘ click that does not raise the window." = "应用未激活时也允许 ⌘-单击调用语义历史。\n默认遵循系统行为：此时 ⌘-单击等同于不置前窗口的普通单击。";
"⌘-click in an active pane while Latterm isn't the active app invokes Semantic History." = "应用未激活时也允许 ⌘-单击调用语义历史。";
"Underline Semantic History-selectable items under the cursor while holding ⌘?" = "按住 ⌘ 悬停时，为可由语义历史打开的项目加下划线。";
"⌘-click in the prompt shows the Command Info window" = "⌘-单击提示符时显示命令信息窗口。";
"Scroll on any scroll wheel movement, no matter how small?" = "响应任意幅度的滚轮移动。";
"Speed up scroll gestures by this factor." = "滚动手势的速度倍率。";
"Fraction of character’s width on its right side that can be used to select the character to its right." = "字符右侧用于选中下一个字符的宽度比例。";
"Horizontal scrolling is reversed when “Natural scrolling” is enabled in System Settings" = "系统启用“自然滚动”时反转水平鼠标滚动报告。";
"Sensitivity of mouse wheel for horizontal scrolling.\nUse 0 to disable. Value should be between 0 and 1. Changes to this setting only affect new sessions." = "鼠标滚轮的水平滚动灵敏度。\n范围为 0–1，0 表示禁用；仅对新建会话生效。";
"Sensitivity of mouse wheel for horizontal scrolling." = "鼠标滚轮的水平滚动灵敏度。";
"Wait to be sure it's not a double click before selecting a command" = "选择命令前等待双击判定完成。";
"Require Option to be pressed to drag a split pane by its title bar?\nThis helps prevent accidental drags." = "按住 Option 才能拖动分屏标题栏。\n用于防止意外拖动。";
"Require Option to be pressed to drag a split pane by its title bar?" = "按住 Option 才能拖动分屏标题栏。";
"Bounce dock icon when the bell rings while another app is active?" = "其他应用激活时，响铃使程序坞图标跳动。";
"Visual bell flashes the whole screen, not just a bell icon." = "可视响铃闪烁整个屏幕。";
"Initial alpha value when flashing the visual bell or search wraparound indicator" = "可视响铃或搜索回绕指示器的初始不透明度。";
"Cursor blink speed (seconds)." = "光标闪烁间隔（秒）。";
"Never set the CTYPE environment variable." = "从不设置 CTYPE 环境变量。";
"Debug: highlight prompt mark prompt/command/excluded ranges in the legacy (non-GPU) renderer.\nWhen enabled, the legacy renderer overlays a blue outline around each visible prompt mark’s prompt range (OSC 133 A to B), a green outline around its command range (B to C), and a red outline around each excluded subrange (PS2 prefixes and right-prompt regions recorded via OSC 133 k=). Disable the Metal renderer (Settings → General → Magic) to see this. Intended for development and bug reports; leave off in normal use." = "调试：在旧版非 GPU 渲染器中标出提示符、命令和排除区域。\n蓝色为提示符（OSC 133 A–B），绿色为命令（B–C），红色为通过 OSC 133 k= 记录的 PS2 和右侧提示符。需关闭 Metal 渲染，仅供开发和问题诊断。";
"Debug: highlight prompt mark prompt/command/excluded ranges in the legacy (non-GPU) renderer." = "调试：在旧版非 GPU 渲染器中标出提示符、命令和排除区域。";
"Threshold for Smart Cursor Color for background color (0 to 1).\n0 means the cursor’s background color will always be the cell’s text color, while 1 means it will always be black or white." = "智能光标背景颜色的阈值（0–1）。\n0 始终使用单元格文字颜色，1 始终使用黑色或白色。";
"Threshold for Smart Cursor Color for background color (0 to 1)." = "智能光标背景颜色的阈值（0–1）。";
"Threshold for Smart Cursor Color for text color (0 to 1).\n0 means the cursor’s text color will always be the cell’s background color, while 1 means it will always be black or white." = "智能光标文字颜色的阈值（0–1）。\n0 始终使用单元格背景颜色，1 始终使用黑色或白色。";
"Threshold for Smart Cursor Color for text color (0 to 1)." = "智能光标文字颜色的阈值（0–1）。";
"When using “Find URLs”, extend results across soft boundaries like tmux pane dividers." = "查找 URL 时跨越 tmux 分屏分隔线等软边界。";
"Amount of time to wait while testing if echo is on (seconds).\nThis is used by the password manager to ensure you're at a password prompt. Set to 0 to disable echo probe." = "检测终端回显状态的等待时间（秒）。\n密码管理器据此确认密码提示符；0 表示禁用检测。";
"Amount of time to wait while testing if echo is on (seconds)." = "检测终端回显状态的等待时间（秒）。";
"Disable animations for showing/hiding password manager." = "禁用密码管理器的显示和隐藏动画。";
"Automatically silence bell when it rings too much." = "响铃过于频繁时自动静音。";
"Variables to report via control sequence\nThis is a comma-delimited list of variables that can be reported with the OSC 1337 ReportVariable=name control sequence. Each variable name must be prefixed with “allow:” or “deny:”." = "允许通过控制序列报告的变量。\n逗号分隔，每个名称以 allow: 或 deny: 开头；适用于 OSC 1337 ReportVariable=name。";
"Variables to report via control sequence" = "允许通过控制序列报告的变量。";
"Restore window contents at startup.\nThis requires “System Settings > Desktop & Dock > Close windows when quitting an app” to be off." = "启动时恢复窗口内容。\n需关闭系统“桌面与程序坞”中的“退出应用程序时关闭窗口”。";
"Restore window contents at startup." = "启动时恢复窗口内容。";
"Maximum number of lines of history to expose to Accessibility.\nAccessibility APIs can make Latterm slow. In order to limit the effect, you can restrict the number of lines in each session that are visible to accessibility. The last lines of each session will be made accessible." = "向辅助功能公开的最大历史行数。\n仅公开每个会话末尾的这些行，避免过多内容拖慢应用。";
"Maximum number of lines of history to expose to Accessibility." = "向辅助功能公开的最大历史行数。";
"Number of screen lines to match against trigger regular expressions.\nTrigger regular expressions are matched against the last logical line of text when a newline is received. A search is performed to find the start of the line. Since very long lines would cause performance problems, the search (and consequently the regular expression match, highlighting, and so on) is limited to this many screen lines." = "触发器正则表达式最多检查的屏幕行数。\n收到换行时从最后一个逻辑行开始匹配；此限制避免超长行导致匹配和高亮过慢。";
"Number of screen lines to match against trigger regular expressions." = "触发器正则表达式最多检查的屏幕行数。";
"Evaluate idempotent triggers periodically in interactive apps, even when triggers in interactive apps are disabled." = "定期检查交互程序中的幂等触发器。";
"When evaluating idempotent triggers in interactive apps, wait this long (in seconds) between updates.\nThis limits the performance impact of trigger evaluation." = "交互程序中幂等触发器的检查间隔（秒）。\n用于限制触发器对性能的影响。";
"When evaluating idempotent triggers in interactive apps, wait this long (in seconds) between updates." = "交互程序中幂等触发器的检查间隔（秒）。";
"To drag images or selected text, you must hold ⌘. This prevents accidental drags." = "按住 ⌘ 才能拖动图片或选中文字。";
"Apps may turn on Focus Reporting.\nFocus reporting causes Latterm to send an escape sequence when a session gains or loses focus. It can cause problems when an ssh session dies unexpectedly because it gets left on, so some users prefer to disable it." = "允许终端程序启用焦点报告。\n会话获得或失去焦点时发送转义序列；SSH 意外断开后可能残留开启状态。";
"Apps may turn on Focus Reporting." = "允许终端程序启用焦点报告。";
"Use fallback for COLORFGBG if no exact match found?\nThe COLORFGBG variable indicates the ANSI colors that match the foreground and background colors. If no colors match and this setting is enabled, then the variable will be set to 15;0 to indicate a dark background or 0;15 to indicate a light background." = "COLORFGBG 没有精确匹配时使用备用值。\n深色背景使用 15;0，浅色背景使用 0;15。";
"Use fallback for COLORFGBG if no exact match found?" = "COLORFGBG 没有精确匹配时使用备用值。";
"Zero-Width Space (U+200B) advances cursor?\nWhile a zero-width space should not advance the cursor per the Unicode spec, both Terminal.app and Konsole do this, and Weechat depends on it. You must restart Latterm after changing this setting." = "零宽空格（U+200B）推进光标。\n兼容 Terminal.app、Konsole 和 Weechat 的行为，但不同于 Unicode 规范；更改后需重启。";
"Zero-Width Space (U+200B) advances cursor?" = "零宽空格（U+200B）推进光标。";
"Cursor occupies line spacing area.\nIf lines have more than 100% vertical spacing and this setting is enabled the bottom of the cursor will be aligned to the bottom of the spacing area." = "光标覆盖额外的行间距区域。\n垂直间距大于 100% 时，光标底部与间距区域底部对齐。";
"Cursor occupies line spacing area." = "光标覆盖额外的行间距区域。";
"Vertical offset for underline cursor.\nPositive values move it up, negative values move it down." = "下划线光标的垂直偏移。\n正值上移，负值下移。";
"Vertical offset for underline cursor." = "下划线光标的垂直偏移。";
"Prevent CSI 3 J from clearing scrollback history?\nThis is also known as the terminfo E3 capability." = "阻止 CSI 3 J 清除滚动历史。\n此序列也称为 terminfo 的 E3 能力。";
"Prevent CSI 3 J from clearing scrollback history?" = "阻止 CSI 3 J 清除滚动历史。";
"Prevent control sequences from changing the current profile?" = "阻止控制序列更改当前配置方案。";
"Maximum number of lines of history to restore.\nWhen the app is relaunched, only the last N lines of history are restored to avoid making launch too slow. If you reduce this number, existing sessions won't be affected until their history is cleared." = "最多恢复的历史行数。\n启动时仅恢复末尾这些行；减小此值后，现有会话需清空历史才生效。";
"Maximum number of lines of history to restore." = "最多恢复的历史行数。";
"Width of vertical bar cursor." = "竖线光标的宽度。";
"Accept OSC 7 to set username, hostname, and path." = "接受 OSC 7 设置用户名、主机名和路径。";
"Show key at cursor at password prompt?" = "在密码提示符处显示钥匙图标。";
"How long (seconds) terminal echo must remain disabled before Latterm treats it as a password prompt.\nThis prevents shell scripts that briefly turn off echo (e.g. while reading the response to an OSC report request) from triggering the password manager. Set to 0 to disable debouncing." = "识别密码提示符前，终端回显必须持续关闭的时间（秒）。\n避免脚本短暂关闭回显时误触密码管理器；0 表示禁用防抖。";
"How long (seconds) terminal echo must remain disabled before Latterm treats it as a password prompt." = "识别密码提示符前，终端回显必须持续关闭的时间（秒）。";
"Tabs wrap around to the next line.\nThis is useful for preserving tabs for later copying to the pasteboard. It breaks backward compatibility and may cause layout problems with programs that don’t expect this behavior." = "制表符可以回绕到下一行。\n有助于复制时保留制表符，但可能破坏不支持此行为的程序布局。";
"Tabs wrap around to the next line." = "制表符可以回绕到下一行。";
"Command to run when handling an ssh:// URL." = "处理 ssh:// URL 时运行的命令。";
"Default tab stop width for new sessions.\nNote: this will break drawing in emacs and other apps." = "新会话的默认制表位宽度。\n更改可能破坏 Emacs 等程序的显示。";
"Default tab stop width for new sessions." = "新会话的默认制表位宽度。";
"Convert italics to reverse video in tmux integration?\nThis is effective when the default TERM reported by tmux matches *screen*." = "tmux 集成中将斜体转换为反色。\n仅在 tmux 报告的默认 TERM 匹配 *screen* 时生效。";
"Convert italics to reverse video in tmux integration?" = "tmux 集成中将斜体转换为反色。";
"Convert italics to reverse video in tmux integration, even when TERM matches *tmux*?\nThis was the default behavior for a long time, but it was incorrect. The conversion should only be done when TERM matches *screen*." = "即使 TERM 匹配 *tmux*，也将斜体转换为反色。\n这是旧版兼容行为；通常仅应对 *screen* 执行转换。";
"Convert italics to reverse video in tmux integration, even when TERM matches *tmux*?" = "即使 TERM 匹配 *tmux*，也将斜体转换为反色。";
"Minimum time between beeping or flashing screen on bell, in seconds.\nIf the time interval between bells is less than this amount of time, it will be ignored." = "两次响铃或屏幕闪烁之间的最短间隔（秒）。\n间隔更短的响铃会被忽略。";
"Minimum time between beeping or flashing screen on bell, in seconds." = "两次响铃或屏幕闪烁之间的最短间隔（秒）。";
"Support TERM=screen\nMost notably, this fixes italics replacing inverse text." = "支持 TERM=screen。\n主要用于修复反色文字被显示成斜体的问题。";
"Support TERM=screen" = "支持 TERM=screen。";
"Set $TERMINFO_DIRS to add modern terminal features to xterm-like $TERMs?\nLatterm ships with extended terminfo capabilities for common TERMs (xterm, xterm-new, and xterm-256color). For example, it enables undercurl. New sessions get created with a TERMINFO_DIRS that make the customized TERMINFOs take precedence over the system defaults." = "通过 TERMINFO_DIRS 为 xterm 系列终端类型启用扩展能力。\n新会话优先使用随应用提供的 terminfo，例如支持波浪下划线。";
"Set $TERMINFO_DIRS to add modern terminal features to xterm-like $TERMs?" = "通过 TERMINFO_DIRS 为 xterm 系列终端类型启用扩展能力。";
"xterm version for secondary device attributes (SDA).\nIncreasing this number enables more features in apps but may break things. Use 95 to recover pre-3.4.10 behavior." = "次级设备属性（SDA）报告的 xterm 版本。\n较大值可启用更多功能，也可能造成兼容问题；95 恢复 3.4.10 之前的行为。";
"xterm version for secondary device attributes (SDA)." = "次级设备属性（SDA）报告的 xterm 版本。";
"Use P3 as default color space? If No, sRGB will be used." = "默认使用 P3 色彩空间。";
"Maximum length for OSC 8 URLs" = "OSC 8 URL 的最大长度。";
"When rendering natively, use wide mode by default?" = "原生渲染时默认使用宽模式。";
"Automatically enable secure keyboard entry at password prompts?" = "在密码提示符处自动启用安全键盘输入。";
"Maximum number of chunks to buffer.\nIn general, these chunks are 1024 bytes. A larger value increases buffer bloat but—up to a limit—can improve performance in the fast path of ASCII text." = "最多缓存的数据块数量。\n每块通常为 1024 字节；适度增大可提高 ASCII 文本吞吐量，也会增加缓存积压。";
"Maximum number of chunks to buffer." = "最多缓存的数据块数量。";
"Duration in seconds of the hotkey window animation.\nWarning: reducing this value may cause problems if you have multiple displays." = "快捷键窗口动画时长（秒）。\n多显示器环境下缩短时长可能造成问题。";
"Duration in seconds of the hotkey window animation." = "快捷键窗口动画时长（秒）。";
"Duration in seconds of the Open Quickly window height animation.\nSet to 0 to disable the animation." = "快速打开窗口的高度动画时长（秒）。\n0 表示禁用动画。";
"Duration in seconds of the Open Quickly window height animation." = "快速打开窗口的高度动画时长（秒）。";
"If the only window is a hotkey window, then clicking the dock icon shows or hides it." = "仅有快捷键窗口时，点击程序坞图标切换显示或隐藏。";
"The hotkey window floats above other windows even when another application is active." = "其他应用激活时，快捷键窗口仍置于最前。";
"The maximum amount of time allowed between presses of a modifier key when performing a modifier double-tap." = "双击修饰键的最大间隔。";
"The minimum amount of time required between presses of a modifier key when performing a modifier double-tap." = "双击修饰键的最小间隔。";
"Show indicator for pinned hotkey windows." = "显示已固定快捷键窗口的指示器。";
"Template for URL of search engine.\nLatterm replaces the string “%@” with the text to search for. Query parameter percent escaping is used." = "搜索引擎 URL 模板。\n%@ 会替换为经过查询参数百分号编码的搜索文字。";
"Template for URL of search engine." = "搜索引擎 URL 模板。";
"Template of URL for typeahead search suggestions." = "输入联想搜索的 URL 模板。";
"Number of autocomplete options to present.\nA value less than 100 is recommended." = "自动补全候选项数量。\n建议小于 100。";
"Number of autocomplete options to present." = "自动补全候选项数量。";
"Grace period for automatic quitting after the last window is closed.\nIf Latterm is configured to quit automatically when the last window is closed, this setting gives a grace period (in seconds) after startup where that feature is disabled. Set to 0 to have no grace period." = "启动后暂缓自动退出的时间（秒）。\n关闭最后一个窗口即退出的功能在此期间不生效；0 表示不暂缓。";
"Grace period for automatic quitting after the last window is closed." = "启动后暂缓自动退出的时间（秒）。";
"Delay after changing number of screens/resolution until refresh (seconds).\nThis works around OS bugs where it takes some time after a screen change before it is safe to resize windows." = "显示器数量或分辨率变化后的刷新延迟（秒）。\n用于绕过系统在显示器刚变化时调整窗口尺寸的问题。";
"Delay after changing number of screens/resolution until refresh (seconds)." = "显示器数量或分辨率变化后的刷新延迟（秒）。";
"Disable App Nap.\nChange effective after restarting Latterm." = "禁用 App Nap。\n更改后需重启 Latterm。";
"Disable App Nap." = "禁用 App Nap。";
"Time in seconds before a session is considered idle.\nUsed for updating icons and activity indicator in tabs." = "会话被视为空闲前的等待时间（秒）。\n影响标签页图标和活动指示器。";
"Time in seconds before a session is considered idle." = "会话被视为空闲前的等待时间（秒）。";
"Time to wait before performing Find action on 1- or 2- character queries." = "搜索一至两个字符时的执行延迟。";
"Maximum number of bytes of selection to provide to Services.\nA large value here can cause performance issues when you have a big selection." = "向系统“服务”提供的选中文字最大字节数。\n过大可能导致处理大量选中文字时变慢。";
"Maximum number of bytes of selection to provide to Services." = "向系统“服务”提供的选中文字最大字节数。";
"Maximum number of bytes of selection to provide to Python API.\nA large value here can cause performance issues when you have a big selection." = "向 Python API 提供的选中文字最大字节数。\n过大可能导致处理大量选中文字时变慢。";
"Maximum number of bytes of selection to provide to Python API." = "向 Python API 提供的选中文字最大字节数。";
"Use Open Directory to determine the user shell" = "使用 Open Directory 确定用户的 shell。";
"Disable DECRQCRA?\nThis control sequence allows an app running in the terminal to read its contents." = "禁用 DECRQCRA。\n此控制序列允许终端中的程序读取终端内容。";
"Disable DECRQCRA?" = "禁用 DECRQCRA。";
"Disable potentially insecure escape sequences.\nSome features of Latterm expand the surface area for security issues. Consider turning this on when viewing untrusted content. The following custom escape sequences will be disabled: RemoteHost, StealFocus, CurrentDir, SetProfile, CopyToClipboard, EndCopy, File, SetBackgroundImageFile, OSC 6’s proxy icon-changing feature. The following DEC sequences are disabled: DECRQCRA. The following xterm extensions are disabled: Window Title Reporting, Icon Title Reporting. This will break displaying inline images, file download, some terminal metadata features, and other features." = "禁用可能存在安全风险的转义序列。\n包括 RemoteHost、StealFocus、CurrentDir、SetProfile、CopyToClipboard、EndCopy、File、SetBackgroundImageFile、OSC 6 图标修改、DECRQCRA 及窗口和图标标题报告。会同时禁用内联图片、文件下载及部分终端元数据功能。";
"Disable potentially insecure escape sequences." = "禁用可能存在安全风险的转义序列。";
"Perform dictionary lookups on force press.\nIf this is NO, force press can still preview eligible local files and images from Semantic History; only dictionary lookups are disabled." = "用力按压时查询词典。\n关闭后仍可预览语义历史中的本地文件和图片。";
"Perform dictionary lookups on force press." = "用力按压时查询词典。";
"Redraw the screen after the Clear Buffer menu item is selected.\nWhen enabled, the TTY size is briefly changed after clearing the buffer to cause the shell or current app to redraw." = "清空缓冲区后重绘屏幕。\n通过临时改变 TTY 尺寸，要求 shell 或当前程序重绘。";
"Redraw the screen after the Clear Buffer menu item is selected." = "清空缓冲区后重绘屏幕。";
"Save scroll buffer when clearing screen.\nWhen enabled, saves the current screen into scroll back buffer instead of clearing it." = "清屏时将当前屏幕保存到滚动历史。";
"Save scroll buffer when clearing screen." = "清屏时将当前屏幕保存到滚动历史。";
"Save the screen to scrollback when an app moves the cursor above the prompt.\nSome full-screen programs that don’t use the alternate screen buffer repaint by moving the cursor to the top of the screen and overwriting whatever was already there, destroying content you can still see. When enabled, Latterm first scrolls the visible screen into history so that content isn’t lost. Requires prompt metadata." = "程序将光标移至提示符上方时，先把屏幕保存到滚动历史。\n避免不使用备用屏幕的全屏程序覆盖可见内容；需要提示符元数据。";
"Save the screen to scrollback when an app moves the cursor above the prompt." = "程序将光标移至提示符上方时，先把屏幕保存到滚动历史。";
"Indicate the number of bells rung while the app is inactive in the dock icon’s badge label" = "应用未激活时，在程序坞徽标中显示响铃次数。";
"Downloads folder.\nIf set, downloaded files go to this location instead of the user’s $HOME/Downloads folder." = "下载目录。\n留空时使用用户的 $HOME/Downloads。";
"Downloads folder." = "下载目录。";
"Suppress confirmation of terminal-initiated downloads?" = "不再确认由终端发起的下载。";
"Command to view man pages.\nUsed when you press the man page button on the touch bar. %@ is replaced with the command. End the command with & to avoid opening a Latterm window (e.g., if you're launching an external viewer)." = "查看 man 手册的命令。\n触控栏按钮使用此命令；%@ 替换为命令名。末尾加 & 可避免打开 Latterm 窗口，适用于外部查看器。";
"Command to view man pages." = "查看 man 手册的命令。";
"Should opening a script with Latterm disable the default profile's “Send Text at Start” setting?\nIf you use “open -a Latterm file.command” or drag a script onto Latterm's icon and this setting is enabled then the script will be executed in lieu of the profile's “Send Text at Start” setting. If this setting is off then both will be executed." = "用 Latterm 打开脚本时替代配置方案中的“启动时发送文本”。\n启用后仅执行脚本；关闭后脚本和启动文本都会执行。";
"Should opening a script with Latterm disable the default profile's “Send Text at Start” setting?" = "用 Latterm 打开脚本时替代配置方案中的“启动时发送文本”。";
"Add status bar icon when excluded from dock?\nWhen you turn on “Exclude from Dock and ⌘-Tab Application Switcher” a status bar icon is added to the menu bar so you can switch the setting back off. Disable this to remove the status bar icon. Doing so makes it very hard to get to Settings. You must restart Latterm after changing this setting." = "从程序坞隐藏时显示菜单栏图标。\n禁用后可能很难再次打开设置；更改后需重启 Latterm。";
"Add status bar icon when excluded from dock?" = "从程序坞隐藏时显示菜单栏图标。";
"Height of the status bar in points.\nThis will also affect the height of per-pane title bars becuase the status bar may be embedded in it. You must restart Latterm after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "状态栏高度（点）。\n也影响可嵌入状态栏的分屏标题栏；更改后需重启。";
"Height of the status bar in points." = "状态栏高度（点）。";
"Should split pane navigation by direction wrap around?" = "按方向切换分屏时循环回绕。";
"Open a new window when you click the dock icon and no windows are already open, and also on app launch when no other windows are open?" = "没有打开窗口时，点击程序坞图标或启动应用会创建新窗口。";
"Open a window at startup?\nThis is useful if you wish to use the system window restoration settings but not create a new window if none would be restored." = "启动时打开窗口。\n关闭后仍可恢复系统保存的窗口，但不会额外创建空窗口。";
"Open a window at startup?" = "启动时打开窗口。";
"How long to wait for the emoji panel to open in seconds?\nFloating hotkey windows adjust their level when the emoji panel is open. If it’s really slow you might need to increase this value to prevent it from appearing beneath a floating hotkey window." = "等待表情符号面板打开的时间（秒）。\n面板出现较慢时可增大此值，避免被悬浮快捷键窗口遮住。";
"How long to wait for the emoji panel to open in seconds?" = "等待表情符号面板打开的时间（秒）。";
"Timeout (seconds) for evaluating RPCs." = "RPC 求值超时（秒）。";
"Path to ftp for opening ftp: URLs.\nYou may want to set this to /usr/local/bin/ftp to use the Homebrew install." = "处理 ftp: URL 的 ftp 程序路径。\n使用 Homebrew 时可设为 /usr/local/bin/ftp。";
"Path to ftp for opening ftp: URLs." = "处理 ftp: URL 的 ftp 程序路径。";
"Path to telnet for opening telnet: URLs.\nYou may want to set this to /usr/local/bin/telnet to use the Homebrew install." = "处理 telnet: URL 的 telnet 程序路径。\n使用 Homebrew 时可设为 /usr/local/bin/telnet。";
"Path to telnet for opening telnet: URLs." = "处理 telnet: URL 的 telnet 程序路径。";
"Value to set LC_CTYPE to if the machine‘s combination of country and language are not supported.\nIf unset, the encoding (e.g., UTF-8) will be used." = "系统语言和地区组合不受支持时使用的 LC_CTYPE 值。\n留空时使用编码名称，例如 UTF-8。";
"Value to set LC_CTYPE to if the machine‘s combination of country and language are not supported." = "系统语言和地区组合不受支持时使用的 LC_CTYPE 值。";
"Treat the top row of keys like number keys on an English keyboard for the purposes of switching panes, tabs, and windows with modifier+number.\nFor example, AZERTY requires you to hold down Shift to enter a number. To switch tabs with ⌘+Number on an AZERTY keyboard, you must enable this setting. Then, for example, ⌘-& switches to tab 1. When this setting is enabled, some user-defined shortcuts may become unavailable because the tab/window/pane switching behavior takes precedence." = "用修饰键加数字切换分屏、标签页和窗口时，按英语键盘识别顶行数字键。\n适用于 AZERTY 等布局，例如 ⌘-& 切换到标签页 1；这些切换操作可能优先于自定义快捷键。";
"Treat the top row of keys like number keys on an English keyboard for the purposes of switching panes, tabs, and windows with modifier+number." = "用修饰键加数字切换分屏、标签页和窗口时，按英语键盘识别顶行数字键。";
"Hotkey windows are excluded from Cycle Through Windows." = "切换窗口时跳过快捷键窗口。";
"Swap Find Next and Find Previous.\nIf enabled, Find Next will search up and Find Previous will search down (Latterm's traditional behavior, which is a departure from macOS's standard). When disabled, search behaves like a normal macOS app." = "交换“查找下一个”和“查找上一个”的方向。\n启用时下一个向上搜索，上一个向下搜索；关闭时遵循 macOS 标准行为。";
"Swap Find Next and Find Previous." = "交换“查找下一个”和“查找上一个”的方向。";
"Pin Edit Session window to the session it originally edited.\nIf not set, it will affect the most recently active session." = "编辑会话窗口始终编辑最初的会话。\n关闭时跟随最近激活的会话。";
"Pin Edit Session window to the session it originally edited." = "编辑会话窗口始终编辑最初的会话。";
"Disable remapping modifiers for system shortcuts.\nThis prevents asking for accessibility permission. It breaks remapping system shortcuts like cmd-tab." = "禁用系统快捷键的修饰键重映射。\n无需请求辅助功能权限，但无法重映射 ⌘-Tab 等系统快捷键。";
"Disable remapping modifiers for system shortcuts." = "禁用系统快捷键的修饰键重映射。";
"Buttons in modal alerts indicate keyboard shortcuts.\nDo you miss Windows 95? I do." = "在模态提示框的按钮上显示键盘快捷键。";
"Buttons in modal alerts indicate keyboard shortcuts." = "在模态提示框的按钮上显示键盘快捷键。";
"Show hints in split pane menu items to indicate horizontal vs vertical semantics.\nYou must restart Latterm after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "在分屏菜单中提示水平和垂直方向的含义。\n更改后需重启 Latterm。";
"Show hints in split pane menu items to indicate horizontal vs vertical semantics." = "在分屏菜单中提示水平和垂直方向的含义。";
"Use old-style find and paste progress indicator views.\nThis change will only affect new windows." = "使用旧版查找和粘贴进度指示器。\n仅影响新建窗口。";
"Use old-style find and paste progress indicator views." = "使用旧版查找和粘贴进度指示器。";
"Synchronize search queries across windows and applications.\nNormally, when you enter a search query in a Find field all find fields in all applications get updated to hold the same value. This is utter nonsense, and can be disabled by setting this preference to No." = "在窗口和应用之间同步搜索词。\n关闭后，各查找栏保留各自的搜索词。";
"Synchronize search queries across windows and applications." = "在窗口和应用之间同步搜索词。";
"Path to folder with dynamic profiles.\nWhen empty, ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles will be used. You must restart Latterm after modifying this setting." = "动态配置方案目录。\n留空时使用 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles；更改后需重启。";
"Path to folder with dynamic profiles." = "动态配置方案目录。";
"Delay between detecting a change to dynamic profiles and acting on it.\nIf a lot of changes happen to the DynamicProfiles folder a longer delay will help coalesce filesystem events to reduce CPU usage." = "检测到动态配置方案变化后的处理延迟。\n频繁修改时可适当增加，以合并文件事件、降低 CPU 占用。";
"Delay between detecting a change to dynamic profiles and acting on it." = "检测到动态配置方案变化后的处理延迟。";
"Add a 'Dynamic' tag to dynamic profiles.\nWhen enabled, dynamic profiles will have a 'Dynamic' tag added to them, which can be used to filter or identify them." = "为动态配置方案添加“Dynamic”标签。\n可用此标签筛选或识别动态配置方案。";
"Add a 'Dynamic' tag to dynamic profiles." = "为动态配置方案添加“Dynamic”标签。";
"$PATH used when running git for the status bar component.\nChange this to use a custom install of git. You must restart Latterm for a change here to take effect." = "状态栏运行 git 时使用的 PATH。\n可指向自定义 git 安装；更改后需重启。";
"$PATH used when running git for the status bar component." = "状态栏运行 git 时使用的 PATH。";
"Maximum pixel height for a single screenshot file.\nScreenshots taller than this will be split into multiple files. Also affects the maximum total pixels (this value squared / 5)." = "单个截图文件的最大高度（像素）。\n超出时拆分为多个文件；总像素数也限制为此值的平方除以 5。";
"Maximum pixel height for a single screenshot file." = "单个截图文件的最大高度（像素）。";
"Folder where the “Save” button in the screenshot window writes files.\nLeave empty to save to the Desktop. The “Save As…” button ignores this and always prompts for a location." = "截图窗口“保存”按钮的保存目录。\n留空时保存到桌面；“另存为…”仍会询问位置。";
"Folder where the “Save” button in the screenshot window writes files." = "截图窗口“保存”按钮的保存目录。";
"Timeout in seconds when running git for the status bar component." = "状态栏运行 git 的超时（秒）。";
"Folder for config files. There must not be a space in the path.\nIf empty, then ~/.config/iterm2 will be the default location." = "配置文件目录。\n路径不能包含空格；留空时使用 ~/.config/iterm2。";
"Folder for config files. There must not be a space in the path." = "配置文件目录。";
"Maximum number of trigger-launched commands that can run at once.\nIf too many “Run Command…” triggers fire their commands will be queued. You must restart Latterm for changes to this setting to take effect." = "触发器同时运行的最大命令数。\n超出时排队等待；更改后需重启。";
"Maximum number of trigger-launched commands that can run at once." = "触发器同时运行的最大命令数。";
"Maximum number of lines before and after the click location to include in smart selection." = "智能选择在点击位置前后最多检查的行数。";
"System notifications should be silent." = "系统通知静音。";
"Omit session identifier from notifications.\nWhen enabled, notifications will only show the message without the session name and tab number prefix." = "通知中省略会话标识。\n仅显示消息，不添加会话名和标签页编号前缀。";
"Omit session identifier from notifications." = "通知中省略会话标识。";
"Perform restorable state integrity checks?" = "检查可恢复状态的完整性。";
"Comma-separated list of LastPass groups for the password manager to look in for passwords." = "密码管理器检索的 LastPass 分组。";
"1Password account name.\nThis is used if you’ve enabled the 1Password integration in the password manager. Use `op account list` to get the list of accounts. This can be an account shorthand, sign-in address, account ID, or user ID." = "1Password 账户名称。\n可填写账户简称、登录地址、账户 ID 或用户 ID；用 op account list 查看可用账户。";
"1Password account name." = "1Password 账户名称。";
"Exclude utun interfaces from network utilization?\nThis is useful if you use a VPN and only want to see the traffic that goes over Wi-Fi or Ethernet." = "网络流量统计排除 utun 接口。\n适用于使用 VPN 时仅查看 Wi-Fi 或以太网流量。";
"Exclude utun interfaces from network utilization?" = "网络流量统计排除 utun 接口。";
"Timeout for downloading settings" = "下载设置的超时。";
"Allow the standard system menu on window Zoom buttons to open?\nmacOS has a bug that makes the app hang. Since this is a rarely used menu, it is disabled by default." = "允许窗口缩放按钮打开系统标准菜单。\n系统问题可能造成应用卡住，因此默认关闭。";
"Allow the standard system menu on window Zoom buttons to open?" = "允许窗口缩放按钮打开系统标准菜单。";
"Bundle ID of browser to open URLs with.\nLeave empty to use system default." = "打开 URL 所用浏览器的 Bundle ID。\n留空时使用系统默认浏览器。";
"Bundle ID of browser to open URLs with." = "打开 URL 所用浏览器的 Bundle ID。";
"Time to wait before showing tips in the main menu.\nSet this to a big number if you don’t like the tips." = "主菜单显示提示前的等待时间。\n增大可减少提示出现。";
"Time to wait before showing tips in the main menu." = "主菜单显示提示前的等待时间。";
"Reveal file created by “Export All Settings and Data” in finder upon completion" = "导出全部设置和数据后，在访达中显示导出文件。";
"Dry-run “Erase All Settings and Data”.\nWhen enabled, the Erase All Settings and Data button logs what it would delete (via NSLog) instead of actually deleting anything, and does not quit. Intended for testing the feature." = "模拟执行“清除全部设置和数据”。\n仅记录将删除的内容，不实际删除或退出；用于测试。";
"Dry-run “Erase All Settings and Data”." = "模拟执行“清除全部设置和数据”。";
"Use zippy text drawing algorithm?\nThis draws non-ASCII text more quickly but with lower fidelity. This setting is ignored if ligatures are enabled in Settings > Profiles > Text." = "使用快速文字绘制算法。\n加快非 ASCII 文字绘制，但精度较低；启用连字时忽略此选项。";
"Use zippy text drawing algorithm?" = "使用快速文字绘制算法。";
"Prefer speed to accuracy for characters with combining marks?" = "绘制组合附加符号时优先速度而非精度。";
"Use adaptive framerate.\nWhen throughput is low, the screen will update at 60 frames per second. When throughput is higher, it will drop to a configurable rate (15 fps by default)." = "启用自适应帧率。\n低吞吐量时以 60 FPS 刷新，高吞吐量时降低到可配置的帧率（默认 15 FPS）。";
"Use adaptive framerate." = "启用自适应帧率。";
"Disable adaptive framerate in interactive apps.\nTurn off adaptive frame rate while in alternate screen mode for more consistent refresh rate. This works even if alternate screen mode is disabled." = "交互程序中禁用自适应帧率。\n在备用屏幕模式下保持稳定刷新率；即使备用屏幕功能被禁用也适用。";
"Disable adaptive framerate in interactive apps." = "交互程序中禁用自适应帧率。";
"When adaptive framerate is enabled, refresh at this rate during high throughput conditions (FPS).\n Does not apply to Metal renderer." = "自适应帧率在高吞吐量时的刷新率（FPS）。\n不适用于 Metal 渲染器。";
"When adaptive framerate is enabled, refresh at this rate during high throughput conditions (FPS)." = "自适应帧率在高吞吐量时的刷新率（FPS）。";
"When adaptive framerate is enabled and using the Metal renderer, refresh at this rate during high throughput conditions (FPS)." = "Metal 自适应帧率在高吞吐量时的刷新率（FPS）。";
"Maximum frame rate (FPS) when adaptive framerate is disabled.\nNote: this is doubled on ARM Macs for displays that support at least 120hz. Modifications to this setting will not affect existing sessions." = "禁用自适应帧率时的最大刷新率（FPS）。\nARM Mac 搭配至少 120 Hz 显示器时此值翻倍；仅影响新会话。";
"Maximum frame rate (FPS) when adaptive framerate is disabled." = "禁用自适应帧率时的最大刷新率（FPS）。";
"Throughput threshold for adaptive frame rate.\nIf more than this many bytes per second are received, use the lower frame rate of 30 fps." = "自适应帧率的吞吐量阈值（字节/秒）。\n超过此值时切换到较低刷新率。";
"Throughput threshold for adaptive frame rate." = "自适应帧率的吞吐量阈值（字节/秒）。";
"Frame rate (FPS) when adaptive framerate is enabled and throughput is low but not 0." = "自适应帧率在低吞吐量但非空闲时的刷新率（FPS）。";
"Maximum frame rate (FPS) when low power mode is enabled." = "低电量模式下的最大刷新率（FPS）。";
"Enable cache of double-width character locations?\nThis should improve performance. It is always on in nightly builds. You must restart Latterm for this setting to take effect." = "缓存双宽字符的位置以提高性能。\n每日构建始终启用；更改后需重启。";
"Enable cache of double-width character locations?" = "缓存双宽字符的位置以提高性能。";
"Use GCD-based update timer instead of NSTimer.\nThis should cause more regular screen updates. Restart Latterm after changing this setting." = "使用 GCD 更新计时器替代 NSTimer。\n可让刷新更均匀；更改后需重启。";
"Use GCD-based update timer instead of NSTimer." = "使用 GCD 更新计时器替代 NSTimer。";
"Draw outline around underline and vertical bar cursors using background color." = "用背景色描绘下划线和竖线光标的轮廓。";
"Use your typeface’s box-drawing characters instead of Latterm’s custom drawing code.\nYou must restart Latterm after changing this setting." = "使用字体自带的框线字符。\n关闭时由 Latterm 绘制；更改后需重启。";
"Use your typeface’s box-drawing characters instead of Latterm’s custom drawing code." = "使用字体自带的框线字符。";
"Minimum weight difference between regular and bold font.\nThis affects selection of the bold version of a font. Font weights go from 0 to 9. If no font can be found that has a high enough weight then the regular font will be double-struck with a small offset." = "常规字体与粗体的最小字重差。\n字重范围为 0–9；找不到足够粗的字体时通过轻微偏移重复绘制。";
"Minimum weight difference between regular and bold font." = "常规字体与粗体的最小字重差。";
"Thickness of underline cursor." = "下划线光标的粗细。";
"Improves drawing performance at the expense of disallowing alphanumeric characters to belong to ligatures." = "禁止字母和数字参与连字以提高绘制性能。";
"Enable contextual alternates (calt) for ligature-capable fonts.\nWhen enabled, uses ligature level 2 which activates calt in addition to standard ligatures. Many coding fonts such as Monaspace, Iosevka, and Cascadia Code require this for their ligatures to work." = "为支持连字的字体启用上下文替代（calt）。\n使用连字级别 2；Monaspace、Iosevka、Cascadia Code 等字体需要此选项。";
"Enable contextual alternates (calt) for ligature-capable fonts." = "为支持连字的字体启用上下文替代（calt）。";
"Force text to be anti-aliased on Retina displays.\nEnable this to use non-AA text on non-retina displays, which sometimes looks better." = "Retina 显示器上强制开启文字抗锯齿。\n可在非 Retina 屏幕关闭抗锯齿时，仍为 Retina 屏幕保留抗锯齿。";
"Force text to be anti-aliased on Retina displays." = "Retina 显示器上强制开启文字抗锯齿。";
"Draw certain Powerline symbols double-width?\nThis matches how most “nerd” fonts render them, but your favorite one might not do this. An example code point that is affected is U+E0B8." = "将部分 Powerline 符号绘制为双宽。\n匹配多数 Nerd Font 的行为，例如 U+E0B8。";
"Draw certain Powerline symbols double-width?" = "将部分 Powerline 符号绘制为双宽。";
"Metal renderer uses integrated GPU when not connected to power?\nFor this to be effective you must disable “Disable Metal renderer when not connected to power”." = "使用电池时让 Metal 渲染器使用集成 GPU。\n需关闭“未接通电源时禁用 Metal 渲染器”。";
"Metal renderer uses integrated GPU when not connected to power?" = "使用电池时让 Metal 渲染器使用集成 GPU。";
"Underline OSC 8 hyperlinks" = "为 OSC 8 超链接加下划线。";
"Use solid underlines?\nWhen disabled, underlines break near text that would intersect them." = "使用连续下划线。\n关闭时下划线会在与文字相交处断开。";
"Use solid underlines?" = "使用连续下划线。";
"Use multi-pass underline renderer?\nFixes underline gaps with ligature fonts. Requires restart." = "使用多遍下划线渲染。\n修复连字字体的下划线间隙；需重启。";
"Use multi-pass underline renderer?" = "使用多遍下划线渲染。";
"Show FPS meter\nRequires Metal renderer" = "显示 FPS 计数器。\n需要 Metal 渲染器。";
"Show FPS meter" = "显示 FPS 计数器。";
"HDR cursor\nExperimental. Half-baked. Probably don't use this." = "启用 HDR 光标。\n尚未完善的实验功能。";
"HDR cursor" = "启用 HDR 光标。";
"GPU renderer redraws at least this often, in seconds.\nThis is to work around a problem where the GPU renderer encounters a lot of latency when drawing for the first time after a short period of inactivity. Set this to a big number to render it ineffectual." = "GPU 渲染器的最长重绘间隔（秒）。\n用于缓解闲置后首次绘制延迟；设为较大值可减少其影响。";
"GPU renderer redraws at least this often, in seconds." = "GPU 渲染器的最长重绘间隔（秒）。";
"Animate graph-based status bar components?\nTurn this off to reduce CPU/GPU usage in WindowServer." = "为图表类状态栏组件启用动画。\n关闭可降低 WindowServer 的 CPU 和 GPU 占用。";
"Animate graph-based status bar components?" = "为图表类状态栏组件启用动画。";
"Disable indicator icons that appear in the top right of a session?\nThis includes the following indicators: maximized pane, broadcast input, coprocess running, alert on next mark, output suppression, zoom, copy mode, and debug logging." = "隐藏会话右上角的状态指示图标。\n包括分屏最大化、广播输入、协同进程、下一标记提醒、输出抑制、缩放、复制模式和调试日志。";
"Disable indicator icons that appear in the top right of a session?" = "隐藏会话右上角的状态指示图标。";
"Include extended symbols when drawing Powerline natively." = "原生绘制 Powerline 时包含扩展符号。";
"Always use line-style marks?" = "始终使用线条样式的标记。";
"Alpha value for shade that covers areas outside the currently selected command." = "选中命令之外区域的遮罩不透明度。";
"Show URL preview on cmd-hover for semantic history matches." = "按住 ⌘ 悬停语义历史匹配项时预览 URL。";
"When animated cursor movement is enabled, only perform animation if the cursor moves at least this distance in points." = "光标动画所需的最小移动距离（点）。";
"Duration in seconds for the “Animate large movements” cursor animation." = "光标“大幅移动动画”的时长（秒）。";
"Duration in seconds for smooth cursor slide animation.\nThis affects the \"Smooth slide\" cursor movement option." = "光标“平滑滑动”动画的时长（秒）。";
"Duration in seconds for smooth cursor slide animation." = "光标“平滑滑动”动画的时长（秒）。";
"Maximum horizontal distance in cells for smooth cursor slide animation.\nCursor movements larger than this will not animate." = "光标平滑滑动的最大水平距离（单元格）。\n超过此距离时不播放动画。";
"Maximum horizontal distance in cells for smooth cursor slide animation." = "光标平滑滑动的最大水平距离（单元格）。";
"Ignore hard newlines for the purposes of locating URLs and file names for Semantic History.\nIf a hard newline occurs at the end of a line then ⌘-click will not see it all unless this setting is turned on. This is useful for some interactive applications. Turning this on will remove newlines from the \\3 and \\4 substitutions." = "语义历史识别 URL 和文件名时忽略硬换行。\n适用于部分交互程序；也会移除 \\3 和 \\4 替换内容中的换行。";
"Ignore hard newlines for the purposes of locating URLs and file names for Semantic History." = "语义历史识别 URL 和文件名时忽略硬换行。";
"Non-alphanumeric characters considered part of a URL or file name for Semantic History.\nLetters and numbers are always considered part of the URL. These non-alphanumeric characters are used in addition for the purposes of figuring out where a URL begins and ends. You must restart Latterm for changes to this setting to take effect." = "语义历史中允许出现在 URL 或文件名中的非字母数字字符。\n字母和数字始终允许；更改后需重启。";
"Non-alphanumeric characters considered part of a URL or file name for Semantic History." = "语义历史中允许出现在 URL 或文件名中的非字母数字字符。";
"Characters never considered part of a URL.\nThe characters in this string may never occur in a URL; when one is seen that delineates the beginning or end of a URL." = "URL 中不允许出现的字符。\n遇到这些字符即视为 URL 的起点或终点。";
"Characters never considered part of a URL." = "URL 中不允许出现的字符。";
"Non-alphanumeric characters considered part of a filename. Note that URL characters (a separate advanced setting) are also allowed.\nLetters and numbers are always considered part of the URL. These non-alphanumeric characters are used in addition for the purposes of figuring out where a file begins and ends. You must restart Latterm for changes to this setting to take effect." = "文件名中允许出现的非字母数字字符。\n同时允许 URL 字符设置中的字符；更改后需重启。";
"Non-alphanumeric characters considered part of a filename. Note that URL characters (a separate advanced setting) are also allowed." = "文件名中允许出现的非字母数字字符。";
"Maximum number of bytes of text before and after click location to take into account.\nThis also limits the size of the \\3 and \\4 substitutions." = "点击位置前后最多检查的文本字节数。\n也限制 \\3 和 \\4 替换内容的大小。";
"Maximum number of bytes of text before and after click location to take into account." = "点击位置前后最多检查的文本字节数。";
"Paths to ignore for Semantic History.\nSeparate paths with a comma. Any file under one of these paths will not be openable with Semantic History. It is wise to add network file systems to this list, since they can be very slow." = "语义历史忽略的路径。\n使用逗号分隔，路径下的文件都不会打开；建议包含速度慢的网络文件系统。";
"Paths to ignore for Semantic History." = "语义历史忽略的路径。";
"Use yellow for a prompt mark when the job is stopped by a signal." = "任务被信号停止时将提示符标记显示为黄色。";
"URLs must contain a scheme?\nEnable this to reduce the number of false positives that semantic history thinks are a URL" = "仅识别包含协议方案的 URL。\n可减少语义历史误识别。";
"URLs must contain a scheme?" = "仅识别包含协议方案的 URL。";
"Characters to ignore at the end of a URL" = "URL 末尾忽略的字符。";
"Default URL scheme.\nThis is applied to hostnames that are not a single word." = "默认 URL 协议方案。\n适用于不是单个单词的主机名。";
"Default URL scheme." = "默认 URL 协议方案。";
"Command to run when opening a clicked URL, instead of asking the OS to open it.\nWhen non-empty, this command runs as a silent background task via /bin/sh -c whenever you click a URL (including OSC 8 hyperlinks and auto-detected URLs) that Latterm would otherwise hand to the system. This is an interpolated string; use \\(url) for the URL and \\(background) for whether a background open was requested (1 if you held option while clicking, otherwise 0). The command is responsible for opening the URL however it likes (e.g., “open -g \\(url)” to open in the background). When empty, URLs open normally. Internal schemes (iterm2:), URL schemes bound to a profile, and Semantic History file links are not affected." = "点击 URL 时执行的自定义命令。\n通过 /bin/sh -c 在后台执行；用 \\(url) 取得 URL，\\(background) 表示是否按住 Option 请求后台打开（1 或 0）。例如 open -g \\(url)。留空时由系统打开；不影响 iterm2:、绑定配置方案的协议或语义历史文件链接。";
"Command to run when opening a clicked URL, instead of asking the OS to open it." = "点击 URL 时执行的自定义命令。";
"Respect soft boundaries for computing the prefix and suffix text passed to semantic history commands?\nDue to a long-standing bug this did not used to be respected. Soft boundaries were always respected for deciding what text was clicked on, but the prefix and suffix did not. If you have a semantic history command that depends on the bug, you can switch this off to get the pre-3.1.2 behavior." = "计算传给语义历史命令的前后缀时遵循软边界。\n关闭可恢复 3.1.2 之前的兼容行为；点击目标本身始终遵循软边界。";
"Respect soft boundaries for computing the prefix and suffix text passed to semantic history commands?" = "计算传给语义历史命令的前后缀时遵循软边界。";
"Enable semantic history for network-mounted filesystems?\nOnly enable this if you know your network-mounted filesystems are really fast and reliable. A slow filesystem may cause the entire Latterm app to hang." = "允许语义历史访问网络文件系统。\n仅应对快速可靠的挂载启用，否则可能使整个应用卡住。";
"Enable semantic history for network-mounted filesystems?" = "允许语义历史访问网络文件系统。";
"Check smart selection actions before existing files on cmd-click?" = "⌘-单击时先检查智能选择操作，再检查现有文件。";
"Disable performing the first matching Smart Selection’s Action on cmd-click?" = "⌘-单击时不执行首个匹配的智能选择操作。";
"Start debug logging automatically when Latterm is launched." = "启动 Latterm 时自动开启调试日志。";
"Append to existing debug log rather than replacing it." = "追加到已有调试日志。";
"Log stats about text drawing performance to console.\nUsed for performance testing." = "将文字绘制性能统计写入控制台。\n用于性能测试。";
"Log stats about text drawing performance to console." = "将文字绘制性能统计写入控制台。";
"Outline dirty rects in the legacy renderer with random colors.\nUseful for visually verifying which regions of the text view are being repainted each frame. This affects only the legacy (non-GPU) renderer and does nothing when the GPU (Metal) renderer is active, so it is not a way to tell whether the GPU renderer is engaged. To use it, first turn off the GPU renderer in Settings → General → Magic." = "在旧版渲染器中用随机颜色标出重绘区域。\n仅影响非 GPU 渲染；需先关闭 Metal，可用于检查每帧重绘范围。";
"Outline dirty rects in the legacy renderer with random colors." = "在旧版渲染器中用随机颜色标出重绘区域。";
"Log restorable state size info to /tmp/statesize.*.txt." = "将恢复状态的大小信息写入 /tmp/statesize.*.txt。";
"Show line buffer block boundaries (issue 6207)" = "显示行缓冲区块的边界（问题 6207）。";
"Debug logs also write to the system log." = "同时将调试日志写入系统日志。";
"Log a detailed trace when a session’s foreground-job ancestor list unexpectedly shrinks.\nWhen an intermediate ancestor (such as the claude CLI) drops out of a tracked session’s foreground-job ancestry for a single process-cache update, log via RLog which pid held the vanished ancestor, whether it is still in the process table, and the full upward walk from the deepest foreground job. Used to diagnose spurious job-ended events that can tear down a Claude Code workgroup. Off by default; turn on only while reproducing an issue." = "前台任务的祖先进程列表意外缩短时记录详细追踪。\n记录消失的进程、进程表状态和完整祖先链，用于诊断误判任务结束；仅在复现问题时启用。";
"Log a detailed trace when a session’s foreground-job ancestor list unexpectedly shrinks." = "前台任务的祖先进程列表意外缩短时记录详细追踪。";
"Override the local hostname used for localhost detection.\nWhen non-empty, the app behaves as though [NSHost fullyQualifiedDomainName] returns this value. Lets you test how localhost detection reacts to a hostname change without actually renaming your computer. Affects hosts reported after you change it; leave empty to use the real hostname." = "覆盖用于本地主机检测的主机名。\n用于测试主机名变化；只影响之后报告的主机。留空时使用真实名称。";
"Override the local hostname used for localhost detection." = "覆盖用于本地主机检测的主机名。";
"Alternate SSH integration python script" = "SSH 集成的替代 Python 脚本。";
"Enable session restoration.\nSession restoration runs jobs in separate processes. They will survive crashes, force quits, and upgrades.\nYou must restart Latterm for this change to take effect." = "启用会话恢复。\n任务在独立进程运行，可在崩溃、强制退出和升级后继续；更改后需重启。";
"Enable session restoration." = "启用会话恢复。";
"Allow sessions to survive logging out and back in.\nThis breaks the “auth sufficient pam_tid.so” hack some people use to allow sudo to authenticate with Touch ID." = "允许会话在退出系统登录后继续运行。\n这会破坏通过 auth sufficient pam_tid.so 为 sudo 启用 Touch ID 的做法。";
"Allow sessions to survive logging out and back in." = "允许会话在退出系统登录后继续运行。";
"User-initiated Quit (⌘Q) of Latterm will kill all running jobs.\nApplies only when session restoration is on." = "主动退出 Latterm（⌘Q）时终止所有运行中的任务。\n仅在启用会话恢复时适用。";
"User-initiated Quit (⌘Q) of Latterm will kill all running jobs." = "主动退出 Latterm（⌘Q）时终止所有运行中的任务。";
"Suppress the Restart Session offer.\nWhen a session terminates, it will offer to restart itself. Turn this on to suppress the offer permanently." = "不再显示重新启动会话的提示。";
"Suppress the Restart Session offer." = "不再显示重新启动会话的提示。";
"When restoring a session without restoring a running job, draw a banner saying “Session Contents Restored” below the restored contents." = "只恢复内容而未恢复任务时，显示“会话内容已恢复”横幅。";
"Automatic session logging appends to existing files.\nWhen set to No, the file will be overwritten instead." = "自动会话日志追加到已有文件。\n关闭时覆盖文件。";
"Automatic session logging appends to existing files." = "自动会话日志追加到已有文件。";
"Format for log timestamps. See Unicode TR 35-31 for syntax.\nYou must restart Latterm for changes to this setting to take effect." = "日志时间戳格式。\n语法参见 Unicode TR 35-31；更改后需重启。";
"Format for log timestamps. See Unicode TR 35-31 for syntax." = "日志时间戳格式。";
"When focus follows mouse is enabled, should new split panes automatically be focused?" = "启用焦点跟随鼠标时自动聚焦新分屏。";
"Suppress restart session confirmation alert.\nDon't ask for a confirmation when manually restarting a session." = "手动重新启动会话时不再确认。";
"Suppress restart session confirmation alert." = "手动重新启动会话时不再确认。";
"Show a “Switched to profile” message when Automatic Profile Switching activates." = "自动切换配置方案时显示切换提示。";
"Preserve font zoom level when Automatic Profile Switching changes profiles." = "自动切换配置方案时保留字体缩放比例。";
"Auto-lock session name after editing it." = "编辑会话名称后自动锁定名称。";
"How long to wait when trying to attach to an iTerm daemon at startup when restoring windows (in seconds)?" = "启动恢复窗口时等待连接会话守护进程的时间（秒）。";
"When logging plain text, include timestamps for each line?" = "纯文本日志为每行添加时间戳。";
"Hex codes to send to clear the command line when entering the composer.\n0x15 is ^U, 0x0b is ^K." = "进入命令编辑器时用于清空命令行的十六进制字节。\n0x15 为 Control-U，0x0b 为 Control-K。";
"Hex codes to send to clear the command line when entering the composer." = "进入命令编辑器时用于清空命令行的十六进制字节。";
"Temporarily add a composer to the status bar instead of opening the large composer view when a status bar is present." = "有状态栏时临时嵌入命令编辑器。";
"When Alert on Next Mark is configured to play a sound, use a file with this name for successful completion of the previous command.\nYou can name a system sound or a file in ~/Library/Sounds." = "下一标记提醒中，命令成功时播放的声音。\n可填写系统声音名称或 ~/Library/Sounds 中的文件名。";
"When Alert on Next Mark is configured to play a sound, use a file with this name for successful completion of the previous command." = "下一标记提醒中，命令成功时播放的声音。";
"When Alert on Next Mark is configured to play a sound, use a file with this name for erroneous completion of the previous command.\nYou can name a system sound or a file in ~/Library/Sounds." = "下一标记提醒中，命令出错时播放的声音。\n可填写系统声音名称或 ~/Library/Sounds 中的文件名。";
"When Alert on Next Mark is configured to play a sound, use a file with this name for erroneous completion of the previous command." = "下一标记提醒中，命令出错时播放的声音。";
"Text displayed when a session ends. Leave empty to use default." = "会话结束时显示的文字。";
"Character to use for divider lines in session end messages. Leave empty to use secure default (BrokenPipeDivider image). Examples: ━ ─ ═ ╌ ┄" = "会话结束消息的分隔线字符。";
"Text displayed when a session is restarted." = "会话重新启动时显示的文字。";
"Text displayed when a short-lived session finishes." = "短暂运行的会话结束时显示的文字。";
"Terminal windows resize smoothly.\nDisables snapping to character grid. Holding Control will temporarily disable snap-to-grid." = "平滑调整终端窗口尺寸。\n禁用字符网格吸附；也可按住 Control 临时取消吸附。";
"Terminal windows resize smoothly." = "平滑调整终端窗口尺寸。";
"If the Profiles window is open, it always moves to join the active Space.\nYou must restart Latterm for a change in this setting to take effect." = "配置方案窗口始终跟随当前桌面空间。\n更改后需重启。";
"If the Profiles window is open, it always moves to join the active Space." = "配置方案窗口始终跟随当前桌面空间。";
"Should growing or shrinking the font in a session that's broadcasting input affect all session that broadcast input?\nThis only applies to changing the font size with Make Text Bigger, Make Text Normal Size, and Make Text Smaller" = "广播输入时同步所有参与会话的字体缩放。\n仅适用于放大、恢复和缩小文字操作。";
"Should growing or shrinking the font in a session that's broadcasting input affect all session that broadcast input?" = "广播输入时同步所有参与会话的字体缩放。";
"When opening multiple fullscreen windows, enter fullscreen one window at a time." = "打开多个全屏窗口时逐个进入全屏。";
"Use a tracking runloop for live resizing.\nThis allows the terminal to redraw during a resizing drag." = "实时调整尺寸时使用跟踪运行循环。\n允许拖动调整窗口时持续重绘终端。";
"Use a tracking runloop for live resizing." = "实时调整尺寸时使用跟踪运行循环。";
"Amount of extra space (in points) between stoplight buttons and inline tab bar.\nThis only takes effect for the Compact and Minimal themes when the tab bar is visible and located at the top of the window." = "窗口控制按钮与内联标签栏之间的额外间距（点）。\n仅适用于标签栏位于顶部且可见的紧凑和极简主题。";
"Amount of extra space (in points) between stoplight buttons and inline tab bar." = "窗口控制按钮与内联标签栏之间的额外间距（点）。";
"Work around a macOS bug where the OS moves windows to the first display for no good reason." = "绕过 macOS 将窗口意外移到第一个显示器的问题。";
"Disable documented edited indicator (black dot in close button)" = "隐藏文稿已修改指示器（关闭按钮中的黑点）。";
"Show window title when the tab bar is not visible?\nWhen disabled, the tab's title will be shown where the window title would normally go." = "标签栏隐藏时显示窗口标题。\n关闭时改为显示标签页标题。";
"Show window title when the tab bar is not visible?" = "标签栏隐藏时显示窗口标题。";
"Windows have square corners.\nThis is only for users who have already hacked macOS to remove rounded corners. You must restart Latterm after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "窗口使用直角。\n仅适用于已经修改 macOS 以去掉圆角的用户；更改后需重启。";
"Windows have square corners." = "窗口使用直角。";
"Border color for focused windows.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb, or #rrggbbaa to also set opacity. You can also use p3#rrggbb or p3#rrggbbaa for p3 color space. Without an alpha component the border is drawn at 75% opacity. Requires “Show border around windows” with no title bar. Leave empty for the default color." = "聚焦窗口的边框颜色。\n使用 #rrggbb、#rrggbbaa 或带 p3 前缀的值；未指定透明度时为 75%。需要无标题栏窗口启用边框；留空使用默认颜色。";
"Border color for focused windows." = "聚焦窗口的边框颜色。";
"Border color for unfocused windows.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb, or #rrggbbaa to also set opacity. You can also use p3#rrggbb or p3#rrggbbaa for p3 color space. Without an alpha component the border is drawn at 75% opacity. Leave empty to match the focused color." = "未聚焦窗口的边框颜色。\n使用 #rrggbb、#rrggbbaa 或带 p3 前缀的值；未指定透明度时为 75%。留空时与聚焦窗口一致。";
"Border color for unfocused windows." = "未聚焦窗口的边框颜色。";
"Show window number in titlebar accessory?" = "在标题栏附件中显示窗口编号。";
"Include keyboard shortcut for windows in Window menu?" = "在“窗口”菜单中显示窗口快捷键。";
"Toolbelt font size in points.\nSet to 0 to use the system default. Changing this setting does not affect existing windows." = "工具栏区域的字号（点）。\n0 使用系统默认值；更改不影响已打开的窗口。";
"Toolbelt font size in points." = "工具栏区域的字号（点）。";
"Toolbelt font family name" = "工具栏区域的字体族名称。";
"Simulated notch height" = "模拟刘海的高度。";
"Custom color for split pane dividers. Leave empty to use default color.\nThis should be an HTML-style color, like #aabbcc." = "分屏分隔线的自定义颜色。\n例如 #aabbcc；留空使用默认颜色。";
"Custom color for split pane dividers. Leave empty to use default color." = "分屏分隔线的自定义颜色。";
"Custom width for split pane dividers in points (1-5). Set to 0 to use default width." = "分屏分隔线的自定义宽度（点）。";
"Custom background color for pane title bars. Leave empty to use default color.\nThis should be an HTML-style color, like #aabbcc." = "分屏标题栏的自定义背景颜色。\n例如 #aabbcc；留空使用默认颜色。";
"Custom background color for pane title bars. Leave empty to use default color." = "分屏标题栏的自定义背景颜色。";
"Custom text color for pane title bars. Leave empty to use default color.\nThis should be an HTML-style color, like #aabbcc." = "分屏标题栏的自定义文字颜色。\n例如 #aabbcc；留空使用默认颜色。";
"Custom text color for pane title bars. Leave empty to use default color." = "分屏标题栏的自定义文字颜色。";
"Allow window resizing by dragging edges and corners?" = "允许拖动窗口边缘和角落调整尺寸。";
"Show secure keyboard entry indicator?" = "显示安全键盘输入指示器。";
"Left-align title bar in Minimal and Compact themes in macOS 26 and later?" = "macOS 26 及以上的极简和紧凑主题中左对齐标题栏。";
"Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration. Affects both windows and tabs.\nThis setting predates having separate settings for windows vs tabs. If it is off, then the two new settings will take effect." = "不再询问 tmux 集成中新标签页或窗口的打开类型。\n旧版总开关；关闭后分别使用窗口和标签页的选项。";
"Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration. Affects both windows and tabs." = "不再询问 tmux 集成中新标签页或窗口的打开类型。";
"Suppress alert asking what kind of window to open in tmux integration.\nNOTE: This only takes effect if the now-deprecated “Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration” setting is off." = "不再询问 tmux 集成中新窗口的打开类型。\n仅当旧版“标签页或窗口”总开关关闭时生效。";
"Suppress alert asking what kind of window to open in tmux integration." = "不再询问 tmux 集成中新窗口的打开类型。";
"Suppress alert asking what kind of tab to open in tmux integration.\nNOTE: This only takes effect if the now-deprecated “Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration” setting is off." = "不再询问 tmux 集成中新标签页的打开类型。\n仅当旧版“标签页或窗口”总开关关闭时生效。";
"Suppress alert asking what kind of tab to open in tmux integration." = "不再询问 tmux 集成中新标签页的打开类型。";
"Tolerate unrecognized commands from server.\nIf disabled, an unknown command from tmux (such as output from ssh or wall) will end the session. Turning this off helps detect dead ssh sessions." = "容忍 tmux 服务器发送无法识别的命令。\n关闭时未知命令（如 SSH 或 wall 的输出）会结束会话，有助于发现失效的 SSH 连接。";
"Tolerate unrecognized commands from server." = "容忍 tmux 服务器发送无法识别的命令。";
"Use black for filler area in tmux windows in full screen." = "全屏 tmux 窗口的空余区域使用黑色。";
"Close tmux windows after detaching?\nThis only takes effect when “Settings > Profiles > Session > After a session ends” is set to “No Action”." = "脱离 tmux 后关闭对应窗口。\n仅在配置方案的会话结束操作为“不执行操作”时生效。";
"Close tmux windows after detaching?" = "脱离 tmux 后关闭对应窗口。";
"Disable window position restoration in tmux integration." = "禁用 tmux 窗口位置恢复。";
"Don't automatically resize tmux windows" = "不自动调整 tmux 窗口尺寸。";
"Where should new tmux windows not created by Latterm open?\n“Focused window” (the default) attaches the window as a tab of whichever Latterm window currently has keyboard focus. “Topmost session window” attaches it to the frontmost Latterm window that already shows a tab from this tmux session, regardless of focus." = "由外部创建的 tmux 窗口的打开位置。\n“聚焦窗口”为默认值；“最前方的会话窗口”选择已显示该 tmux 会话的最前方窗口，不受键盘焦点影响。";
"Where should new tmux windows not created by Latterm open?" = "由外部创建的 tmux 窗口的打开位置。";
"Poll for foreground job name in tmux integration with tmux < 3.2?\nThis enables tab icons but can cause a lot of background traffic. This has no effect in tmux 3.2 and later, where polling is unnecessary." = "为 tmux 3.2 之前的版本轮询前台任务名称。\n支持标签页图标，但可能产生大量后台流量；tmux 3.2 及以上无需轮询。";
"Poll for foreground job name in tmux integration with tmux < 3.2?" = "为 tmux 3.2 之前的版本轮询前台任务名称。";
"Insert this string at the start of tab and window titles to indicate tmux integration." = "tmux 集成的标签页和窗口标题前缀。";
"When using tmux integration, should the tmux client name (typically the name of the attaching session or the host name) appear in brackets in the window title?" = "在窗口标题中用方括号显示 tmux 客户端名称。";
"Remember window sizes in tmux integration?\nRequires tmux 2.9 or later. The “variable window size” advanced setting must be enabled." = "记住 tmux 窗口尺寸。\n需要 tmux 2.9 及以上，并启用可变窗口尺寸。";
"Remember window sizes in tmux integration?" = "记住 tmux 窗口尺寸。";
"Open tmux windows and tabs in the background?\nWhen enabled, attaching with tmux -CC (or when tmux creates a new window) will reveal the window or tab without moving keyboard focus to it. Focus stays on the attaching session." = "在后台打开 tmux 窗口和标签页。\n通过 tmux -CC 连接或创建窗口时保留原连接会话的键盘焦点。";
"Open tmux windows and tabs in the background?" = "在后台打开 tmux 窗口和标签页。";
"Command used to set the `uname` variable for remote-host metadata." = "设置远程主机元数据 uname 变量的命令。";
"Valid characters in SSH user names\nAlphanumerics are always valid. This specifies other valid characters." = "SSH 用户名允许的额外字符。\n字母和数字始终有效。";
"Valid characters in SSH user names" = "SSH 用户名允许的额外字符。";
"Suppress a warning when ⌥ Key Acts as Meta is enabled in Settings > Profiles > Keys." = "启用 Option 作为 Meta 键时不再警告。";
"Suppress a warning about how to configure Spaces when setting a window's Space." = "设置窗口所属桌面空间时不再提示空间配置方式。";
"Suppress a warning about a change to a Profile key setting that overrides a global setting." = "配置方案快捷键覆盖全局快捷键时不再警告。";
"Suppress a warning about a change to a global key that's overridden by a Profile." = "全局快捷键被配置方案覆盖时不再警告。";
"Suppress changed-setting warning when settings are loaded from a custom folder." = "从自定义目录加载设置时不再警告设置变更。";
"Suppress offer to silence bell when it rings too much." = "响铃过于频繁时不再建议静音。";
"Suppress warning about multi-line paste when pasting a single line ending with a newline.\nThis suppresses all multi-line paste warnings when a single line is being pasted." = "粘贴以换行结尾的单行文本时不再显示多行粘贴警告。";
"Suppress warning about multi-line paste when pasting a single line ending with a newline." = "粘贴以换行结尾的单行文本时不再显示多行粘贴警告。";
"Suppress warning about multi-line paste when not at prompt.\nRequires prompt metadata." = "不在 shell 提示符处时不再显示多行粘贴警告。\n需要提示符元数据。";
"Suppress warning about multi-line paste when not at prompt." = "不在 shell 提示符处时不再显示多行粘贴警告。";
"Suppress warning about broadcasting input." = "不再警告广播输入。";
"Suppress kill/hide dialog when closing a tmux window." = "关闭 tmux 窗口时不再询问终止或隐藏。";
"Suppress kill/hide dialog when closing a tmux tab." = "关闭 tmux 标签页时不再询问终止或隐藏。";
"Suppress warning when pasting tabs with offer to convert them to spaces or perform advanced paste." = "粘贴制表符时不再询问转换为空格或使用高级粘贴。";
"Warn about short-lived sessions that live less than this many seconds." = "运行时间短于此值的会话结束时发出警告（秒）。";
"Suppress warning about multi-line pastes (or a single line ending in a newline).\nThis applies whether you are at the shell prompt or not, provided two or more lines are being pasted." = "不再显示多行粘贴警告。\n包含以换行结尾的单行文本；粘贴多行时无论是否位于 shell 提示符处都适用。";
"Suppress warning about multi-line pastes (or a single line ending in a newline)." = "不再显示多行粘贴警告。";
"Suppress warning about pasting a single line ending in a newline when at the shell prompt.\nThis requires prompt metadata." = "在 shell 提示符处粘贴以换行结尾的单行文本时不再警告。\n需要提示符元数据。";
"Suppress warning about pasting a single line ending in a newline when at the shell prompt." = "在 shell 提示符处粘贴以换行结尾的单行文本时不再警告。";
"Suppress warning about copying a session's settings over a Profile" = "用会话设置覆盖配置方案时不再警告。";
"Always turn off focus reporting when host changes?" = "主机变化时始终关闭焦点报告。";
"Always turn off mouse reporting when host changes?" = "主机变化时始终关闭鼠标报告。";
"Always turn off paste bracketing when host changes?" = "主机变化时始终关闭括号粘贴模式。";
"Suppress the notification that the terminal attempted to access the clipboard but it was denied?" = "终端访问剪贴板被拒绝时不再通知。";
"Suppress the notification that a restored session’s profile no longer exists?" = "恢复会话时发现原配置方案不存在，不再通知。";
"Suppress the notification asking if you want to disable mouse reporting that is shown after a drag followed by Cmd-C when mouse reporting is on?" = "鼠标报告开启时，拖动后按 ⌘-C 不再提示关闭鼠标报告。";
"Suppress the notification asking if you want to disable resize reporting" = "不再提示关闭窗口尺寸报告。";
"Suppress warning about sending a signal to terminate a job.\nThis is used in the process tree, which you can find the toolbelt or by clicking the Jobs status bar component." = "发送信号终止任务时不再警告。\n适用于工具栏区域或任务状态栏组件中的进程树。";
"Suppress warning about sending a signal to terminate a job." = "发送信号终止任务时不再警告。";
"Suppress confirmation to remove annotation?" = "删除批注时不再确认。";
"Disable control sequence to open URLs?" = "禁用通过控制序列打开 URL。";
"Trim whitespace when copying to pasteboard." = "复制到剪贴板时去除首尾空白。";
"Number of bytes to paste in each chunk when pasting normally." = "普通粘贴时每个数据块的字节数。";
"Number of bytes to paste in each chunk when pasting slowly." = "慢速粘贴时每个数据块的字节数。";
"Delay in seconds between chunks when pasting slowly" = "慢速粘贴时数据块之间的延迟（秒）。";
"Copy to pasteboard on selection includes color and font style." = "选中即复制时包含颜色和字体样式。";
"Exclude the default background color when text is copied with color and font style?\nWhen off, the default background color will be left unset. Non-default background colors will remain." = "带样式复制时保留默认背景色。\n关闭时不设置默认背景色，非默认背景色保留。";
"Exclude the default background color when text is copied with color and font style?" = "带样式复制时保留默认背景色。";
"Number of entries to save in Paste History.\n" = "粘贴历史最多保存的条目数。";
"Number of entries to save in Paste History." = "粘贴历史最多保存的条目数。";
"Disallow copying empty string to pasteboard.\nIf enabled, selecting an empty string (or all whitespace if trimming is enabled) will not erase the contents of the pasteboard." = "不允许复制空字符串。\n启用后，空白选择不会清除剪贴板；开启去除空白时也适用于全空白文本。";
"Disallow copying empty string to pasteboard." = "不允许复制空字符串。";
"Pressing a key will remove the selection." = "输入按键后取消选择。";
"Pasting text will remove the selection." = "粘贴文字后取消选择。";
"Warn before pasting when not at shell prompt?" = "不在 shell 提示符处粘贴时发出警告。";
"Exclude all background colors when text is copied with color and font style?\nThis includes both the default background color and non-default background colors." = "带样式复制时排除全部背景色。\n同时排除默认和非默认背景色。";
"Exclude all background colors when text is copied with color and font style?" = "带样式复制时排除全部背景色。";
"Include paste history in the advanced paste menu." = "高级粘贴菜单包含粘贴历史。";
"When pasting more than this many characters, require confirmation.\nSet to -1 to disable warning.\nCharacters are counted in UTF-16." = "粘贴超过此字符数时要求确认。\n设为 -1 禁用；按 UTF-16 代码单元计数。";
"When pasting more than this many characters, require confirmation." = "粘贴超过此字符数时要求确认。";
"Save to paste history when secure keyboard input is enabled?" = "安全键盘输入开启时仍保存粘贴历史。";
"Disable the Tip of the Day?" = "禁用每日提示。";
"Time between tips (in seconds)" = "提示之间的间隔（秒）。";
"Font to use for the badge." = "徽标使用的字体。";
"Should the badge render in bold type?" = "徽标使用粗体。";
"Maximum width of the badge\nAs a fraction of the width of the terminal, between 0 and 1.0. This is the default value if a profile does not have a setting." = "徽标的最大宽度比例。\n相对于终端宽度，范围为 0–1；配置方案未单独设置时使用此值。";
"Maximum width of the badge" = "徽标的最大宽度比例。";
"Maximum height of the badge\nAs a fraction of the height of the terminal, between 0 and 1.0. This is the default value if a profile does not have a setting." = "徽标的最大高度比例。\n相对于终端高度，范围为 0–1；配置方案未单独设置时使用此值。";
"Maximum height of the badge" = "徽标的最大高度比例。";
"Default value for right margin for the badge\nHow much space to leave between the right edge of the badge and the right edge of the terminal. Can be overridden by a profile setting. This is the default value if a profile does not have a setting." = "徽标默认右边距。\n徽标右侧与终端右侧之间的距离；可由配置方案覆盖。";
"Default value for right margin for the badge" = "徽标默认右边距。";
"Default value for the top margin for the badge\nHow much space to leave between the top edge of the badge and the top edge of the terminal. Can be overridden by a profile setting. This is the default value if a profile does not have a setting." = "徽标默认上边距。\n徽标顶部与终端顶部之间的距离；可由配置方案覆盖。";
"Default value for the top margin for the badge" = "徽标默认上边距。";
"Kill sessions on logout.\nA possible fix for issue 4147." = "退出系统登录时终止会话。\n可能解决问题 4147。";
"Kill sessions on logout." = "退出系统登录时终止会话。";
"Use a more theoretically correct technique to measure line height.\nYou must restart Latterm or adjust a session's font size for this change to take effect." = "使用实验性的行高测量方式。\n重启 Latterm 或调整会话字号后生效。";
"Use a more theoretically correct technique to measure line height." = "使用实验性的行高测量方式。";
"Enable low-latency updates of the current foreground job" = "低延迟更新当前前台任务。";
"Allow variable window sizes in tmux integration.\nRequres tmux version 2.9 or later." = "允许 tmux 集成使用可变窗口尺寸。\n需要 tmux 2.9 及以上。";
"Allow variable window sizes in tmux integration." = "允许 tmux 集成使用可变窗口尺寸。";
"Detect base unicode characters with lookup table.\nApple's algorithm for segmenting composed characters makes bad choices, such as for Tamil. Enable this to reduce text overlapping." = "使用查找表检测 Unicode 基础字符。\n减少系统组合字符分段算法在泰米尔文等文字中造成的重叠。";
"Detect base unicode characters with lookup table." = "使用查找表检测 Unicode 基础字符。";
"Escape file names with single quotes instead of backslashes.\nThis is intended for users of xonsh, which does not accept backslash escaping." = "用单引号转义文件名。\n适用于不接受反斜杠转义的 xonsh 等 shell。";
"Escape file names with single quotes instead of backslashes." = "用单引号转义文件名。";
"List of fonts to use alternate rounding algorithm for line height calculation.\nThis fixes consolas and emulates Terminal.app’s behavior on macOS 10.15. This is a comma-delimited list of font family substrings." = "使用替代行高取整算法的字体列表。\n逗号分隔的字体族名称片段；修复 Consolas 并模拟 macOS 10.15 的终端行为。";
"List of fonts to use alternate rounding algorithm for line height calculation." = "使用替代行高取整算法的字体列表。";
"Improved support for input method editors like AquaSKK." = "改进 AquaSKK 等输入法的按键处理。";
"Allow function keys to be handled by macOS text input system.\nThis supports using function keys with modifiers as compose/dead keys in custom keyboard layouts." = "允许 macOS 文本输入系统处理功能键。\n支持自定义键盘布局将带修饰键的功能键作为组合键或死键。";
"Allow function keys to be handled by macOS text input system." = "允许 macOS 文本输入系统处理功能键。";
"Disable metal renderer when idle to save CPU utilization?\nRequires Metal renderer" = "空闲时禁用 Metal 渲染器以减少 CPU 占用。\n需要 Metal 渲染器。";
"Disable metal renderer when idle to save CPU utilization?" = "空闲时禁用 Metal 渲染器以减少 CPU 占用。";
"Extend background color into margins in alternate screen mode?" = "备用屏幕模式下将背景色延伸到边距区域。";
"Enable support for REP (Repeat previous character) escape sequence?" = "支持 REP（重复前一个字符）转义序列。";
"Report multiple mouse scroll events when scrolling quickly?" = "快速滚动时报告多个鼠标滚动事件。";
"Use modern scroll wheel accumulator.\nThis should support wheel mice better and feel more natural." = "使用新版滚轮累加器。\n改善滚轮鼠标的响应和手感。";
"Use modern scroll wheel accumulator." = "使用新版滚轮累加器。";
"Reset colors at shell prompt?\nUses prompt metadata to detect a shell prompt and, if enabled, resets colors to their defaults." = "在 shell 提示符处重置颜色。\n需要提示符元数据。";
"Reset colors at shell prompt?" = "在 shell 提示符处重置颜色。";
"Show inline images at Retina resolution." = "以 Retina 分辨率显示内联图片。";
"Reduce number of frames in flight when GPU can't produce drawables quickly." = "GPU 无法及时提供可绘制对象时，减少同时处理的帧数。";
"Use synchronized Metal drawable presentation?\nDefers drawable acquisition until rendering completes, presents synchronously with Core Animation, and acquires drawables on the private render queue. May improve frame rates." = "同步呈现 Metal 绘制结果。\n渲染完成后获取可绘制对象，与 Core Animation 同步呈现，并使用独立渲染队列；可能提高帧率。";
"Use synchronized Metal drawable presentation?" = "同步呈现 Metal 绘制结果。";
"Cache per-row GPU build output?\nSkips rebuilding the glyph and color data for rows whose content and configuration have not changed since the last frame. Experimental." = "缓存每行的 GPU 构建结果。\n内容和配置未变化时跳过字形与颜色数据重建；实验功能。";
"Cache per-row GPU build output?" = "缓存每行的 GPU 构建结果。";
"SSH URLs respect the path.\nThey run the command: ssh -t \"cd $$PATH$$; exec \\$SHELL -l\"" = "SSH URL 支持路径。\n执行 ssh -t “cd $$PATH$$; exec \\$SHELL -l”。";
"SSH URLs respect the path." = "SSH URL 支持路径。";
"When splitting a pane, use the profile with local modifications, not the backing profile." = "分屏时使用包含当前局部修改的配置方案。";
"Support modifier remapping for keystrokes originated by Synergy." = "支持重映射由 Synergy 发送的修饰键。";
"Set LC_TERMINAL=iTerm2.\nopenssh and mosh pass this to hosts you connect to. It communicates the current terminal emulator. This is useful for enabling terminal emulator-specific features." = "设置 LC_TERMINAL=iTerm2。\nOpenSSH 和 mosh 会传递给远程主机，用于识别终端并启用对应功能。";
"Set LC_TERMINAL=iTerm2." = "设置 LC_TERMINAL=iTerm2。";
"Clear bell icon when a session becomes active.\nWhen off, you must type in the session to clear the bell icon." = "会话激活时立即清除响铃图标。\n关闭时需在会话中输入后才清除。";
"Clear bell icon when a session becomes active." = "会话激活时立即清除响铃图标。";
"Treat the equals sign on the numeric keypad as a key on the numeric keypad.\nFor mysterious reasons, macOS does not treat this key as belonging to the numeric keypad. Enable this setting to work around the bug." = "将数字小键盘的等号键识别为小键盘按键。\n用于绕过 macOS 的识别问题。";
"Treat the equals sign on the numeric keypad as a key on the numeric keypad." = "将数字小键盘的等号键识别为小键盘按键。";
"Enable character accent menu.\nThis disables the ordinary key repeat behavior for press-and-hold. You must restart Latterm for this change to take effect." = "启用长按字符显示重音菜单。\n会禁用普通的按键重复；更改后需重启。";
"Enable character accent menu." = "启用长按字符显示重音菜单。";
"Make uploads with it2ul really fast." = "加速 it2ul 上传。";
"Enable multi-server daemon.\nA new implementation of session restoration that combines daemon processes." = "启用多会话服务器守护进程。\n将多个守护进程合并的新版会话恢复实现。";
"Enable multi-server daemon." = "启用多会话服务器守护进程。";
"Enable restorable state controller?\nThis makes window restoration more reliable." = "启用可恢复状态控制器。\n提高窗口恢复的可靠性。";
"Enable restorable state controller?" = "启用可恢复状态控制器。";
"Mouse wheel always scrolls when scroll bars are visible" = "滚动条可见时，鼠标滚轮始终滚动内容。";
"Report 16-bit color values to OSC 4 and 10 through 19.\nWorks around a bug in older vim where they could not properly parse 8-bit values." = "向 OSC 4 和 OSC 10–19 报告 16 位颜色值。\n兼容无法正确解析 8 位颜色的旧版 Vim。";
"Report 16-bit color values to OSC 4 and 10 through 19." = "向 OSC 4 和 OSC 10–19 报告 16 位颜色值。";
"Show search result and prompt locations in scroll bar.\nChanging this setting will not affect existing sessions until you restart." = "在滚动条上显示搜索结果和提示符位置。\n现有会话需重启后生效。";
"Show search result and prompt locations in scroll bar." = "在滚动条上显示搜索结果和提示符位置。";
"Show prompt locations in scroll bar?\nChanging this setting will not affect existing sessions until you restart. You must also enable “Show search result and prompt locations in scroll bar” for this to take effect." = "在滚动条上显示提示符位置。\n还需启用“显示搜索结果和提示符位置”；现有会话需重启后生效。";
"Show prompt locations in scroll bar?" = "在滚动条上显示提示符位置。";
"Make the tab bar a titlebar accessory view in Big Sur?" = "在 Big Sur 中将标签栏作为标题栏附件。";
"Store window restoration state in SQLite" = "用 SQLite 保存窗口恢复状态。";
"Save unlimited amount of window contents.\nThis is going to be slow unless you enable SQLite-based window restoration too." = "保存不受数量限制的窗口内容。\n建议同时启用 SQLite 窗口恢复，否则速度可能较慢。";
"Save unlimited amount of window contents." = "保存不受数量限制的窗口内容。";
"Support variation selector 16 making emoji fullwidth in all modes?" = "支持变体选择符 16 在所有模式下将表情符号变为全宽。";
"Support variation selector 16 making emoji fullwidth outside of alternate screen mode?" = "支持变体选择符 16 在主屏幕模式下将表情符号变为全宽。";
"Trackpad scrolls fast?\nSet to No for legacy scrolling speed." = "启用快速触控板滚动。\n关闭可使用旧版滚动速度。";
"Trackpad scrolls fast?" = "启用快速触控板滚动。";
"Support DECSET 1036?\nThis allows apps in the terminal to control whether the option key sends esc+ or acts like a regular option key." = "支持 DECSET 1036。\n允许终端程序控制 Option 键发送 Esc 前缀或保留常规 Option 行为。";
"Support DECSET 1036?" = "支持 DECSET 1036。";
"Fast regular expression evaluation for triggers.\nThis is experimental because it could potentially change how regular expressions are interpreted." = "快速计算触发器正则表达式。\n实验功能，可能改变正则表达式的解释方式。";
"Fast regular expression evaluation for triggers." = "快速计算触发器正则表达式。";
"Post fake flags-changed events when remapping modifiers with an event tap.\nThis is an attempt to work around incompatibilities with AltTab in issue 10220." = "重映射修饰键时发送模拟的修饰键变化事件。\n用于尝试解决与 AltTab 的兼容问题（10220）。";
"Post fake flags-changed events when remapping modifiers with an event tap." = "重映射修饰键时发送模拟的修饰键变化事件。";
"Lone regional indicators render full-width.\nA complete flag is always two columns, which is the width wcwidth reports for the pair." = "单个区域指示符使用全宽。\n完整的旗帜始终占两列，与 wcwidth 对该字符对报告的宽度一致。";
"Pre-convert non-ASCII strings to screen characters on the parser thread.\nThis exploits parallelism between parsing and screen mutation for better performance." = "在解析线程上预先转换非 ASCII 字符串。\n利用解析与屏幕修改并行来提高性能。";
"Pre-convert non-ASCII strings to screen characters on the parser thread." = "在解析线程上预先转换非 ASCII 字符串。";
"Pre-convert long non-ASCII strings on a background queue.\nThis decouples preconversion from the parser thread for better throughput." = "在后台队列中预先转换较长的非 ASCII 字符串。\n与解析线程分离以提高吞吐量。";
"Pre-convert long non-ASCII strings on a background queue." = "在后台队列中预先转换较长的非 ASCII 字符串。";
"Minimum string length (in UTF-16 code units) to dispatch for async pre-conversion." = "异步预转换的最小字符串长度（UTF-16 代码单元）。";
"Maximum bytes of outstanding async pre-conversions.\nWhen this limit is reached, new strings are converted synchronously on the mutation thread." = "等待异步预转换的最大字节数。\n达到限制时在屏幕修改线程同步转换新字符串。";
"Maximum bytes of outstanding async pre-conversions." = "等待异步预转换的最大字节数。";
"Log a histogram of non-ASCII string lengths periodically.\nUseful for tuning the async pre-conversion minimum string length." = "定期记录非 ASCII 字符串长度直方图。\n用于调整异步预转换的最小长度。";
"Log a histogram of non-ASCII string lengths periodically." = "定期记录非 ASCII 字符串长度直方图。";
"Add path to Latterm utilities to $PATH for new sessions?" = "为新会话的 PATH 添加 Latterm 工具目录。";
"Automatically search for selected text after making a selection?" = "选择文字后自动搜索所选内容。";
"Enable more compact logging when using auto composer?\nThis will avoid logging raw data in your prompt and your interactions with it. Instead, the prompt is logged once in plain text and the command is logged when sent." = "自动命令编辑器使用精简日志。\n提示符只记录一次纯文本，命令在发送时记录，省略编辑过程的原始数据。";
"Enable more compact logging when using auto composer?" = "自动命令编辑器使用精简日志。";
"Disclaim ownership of children.\nBy enabling this, when launching a Cocoa app from a terminal window TCC should attribute ownership to the app, not Latterm, for permissions. In order for changes to this setting to take effect, you must kill iTermServer." = "放弃子进程的归属权。\n从终端启动 Cocoa 应用时，TCC 权限归属于该应用；更改后需终止 iTermServer 才生效。";
"Disclaim ownership of children." = "放弃子进程的归属权。";
"Automatically restore keyboard mode when an ssh session ends?" = "SSH 会话结束时自动恢复键盘模式。";
"Aggressively keep windows on the screen they were configured to be on" = "持续将窗口保持在配置指定的显示器上。";
"Allow pairing a companion iOS device?\nOff by default while this feature is in development. When off, the Companion Device Settings menu item is hidden. Managed environments can also use this to disable the feature. The user defaults key is `CompanionPairingAllowed`." = "允许配对 iOS 伴侣设备。\n开发阶段默认关闭，同时隐藏设备设置菜单；受管理环境也可禁用。配置键为 CompanionPairingAllowed。";
"Allow pairing a companion iOS device?" = "允许配对 iOS 伴侣设备。";
"Relay origin for companion iOS device pairing.\nMust be a bare https origin (scheme and host, no path), such as https://companion-relay.iterm2.com. The relay is the only transport, so this must be set for pairing to work; forks can point it at their own Worker. Leave empty to disable the relay entirely. The user defaults key is `CompanionRelayOrigin`." = "iOS 伴侣配对的中继源地址。\n仅含 https 协议和主机，不含路径，例如 https://companion-relay.iterm2.com；配对需要中继，留空则禁用。配置键为 CompanionRelayOrigin。";
"Relay origin for companion iOS device pairing." = "iOS 伴侣配对的中继源地址。";
"Shard-map URL for companion iOS device pairing.\nAn https URL pointing directly at the static shard-map JSON, used to find the relay shard that serves the phone-to-mac connection. It is fetched verbatim (nothing is appended). Leave empty to use direct connections (such as if you run your own relay)." = "iOS 伴侣配对的分片映射 URL。\n填写直接指向静态分片映射 JSON 的 HTTPS URL，不会追加路径；留空用于直接连接自建中继。";
"Shard-map URL for companion iOS device pairing." = "iOS 伴侣配对的分片映射 URL。";
"When right-to-left text support is enabled, also support it in alternate screen mode?" = "启用从右向左文字支持时，也在备用屏幕模式下支持。";
"Right-justify lines in paragraphs with base writing direction of right-to-left?\nRequires BOTH “right-to-left text support” and “auto-detect paragraph writing detection” to be enabled." = "基础方向为从右向左的段落右对齐。\n需同时启用从右向左文字支持及段落方向自动检测。";
"Right-justify lines in paragraphs with base writing direction of right-to-left?" = "基础方向为从右向左的段落右对齐。";
"Auto-detect paragraph writing direction based on the first strong directional character?\nRequires right-to-left text support to be enabled." = "根据首个强方向字符自动检测段落书写方向。\n需启用从右向左文字支持。";
"Auto-detect paragraph writing direction based on the first strong directional character?" = "根据首个强方向字符自动检测段落书写方向。";
"Stamp frame numbers into the iTerm2 Buddy live stream?\nDraws a monotonic counter onto each streamed video frame, for debugging the phone’s live session view." = "在 iTerm2 Buddy 实时画面上显示帧号。\n每帧叠加递增计数，用于调试手机端实时会话。";
"Stamp frame numbers into the iTerm2 Buddy live stream?" = "在 iTerm2 Buddy 实时画面上显示帧号。";
"iTerm2 Buddy live stream: maximum capture-time lead, in milliseconds.\nThe host stops sending new frames once it is more than this far ahead of the last frame the phone acknowledged, then resumes when the phone catches up. Larger values tolerate more link latency at the cost of a live view that can lag further behind. Only the frame rate is affected; per-frame quality is unchanged." = "iTerm2 Buddy 实时画面的最大采集领先时间（毫秒）。\n主机超过手机最后确认帧此时长后暂停发送，追上后恢复；较大值容忍更高延迟，但画面可能更滞后。仅影响帧率。";
"iTerm2 Buddy live stream: maximum capture-time lead, in milliseconds." = "iTerm2 Buddy 实时画面的最大采集领先时间（毫秒）。";
"iTerm2 Buddy live stream: maximum phone decode-queue depth.\nThe host stops sending new frames once the phone reports more than this many frames queued for decode/display, then resumes as the queue drains. Larger values let more frames pile up on the phone before backing off. Only the frame rate is affected; per-frame quality is unchanged." = "iTerm2 Buddy 手机端解码队列的最大深度。\n超过此帧数时主机暂停发送，队列消退后恢复；较大值允许积压更多帧。仅影响帧率。";
"iTerm2 Buddy live stream: maximum phone decode-queue depth." = "iTerm2 Buddy 手机端解码队列的最大深度。";
"iTerm2 Buddy live stream: video bitrate multiplier.\nScales the resolution-derived encoder bitrate. Values above 1 make streamed text sharper at the cost of bandwidth; values below 1 save bandwidth at the cost of sharpness. The result is still clamped to the stream’s minimum and ceiling bitrates." = "iTerm2 Buddy 实时视频的码率倍率。\n大于 1 更清晰但占用更多带宽，小于 1 更省带宽；仍受最低和最高码率限制。";
"iTerm2 Buddy live stream: video bitrate multiplier." = "iTerm2 Buddy 实时视频的码率倍率。";
"iTerm2 Buddy push notifications: minimum seconds between wakeup pushes." = "iTerm2 Buddy 唤醒推送的最小间隔（秒）。";
"URL to check for new versions of the Python scripting runtime." = "检查 Python 脚本运行时更新的 URL。";
"URL to check for new Beta versions of the Python scripting runtime." = "检查 Python 脚本运行时测试版更新的 URL。";
"Should references to undefined variables in interpolated strings be converted to empty string?\nWhen enabled, an expression in an interpolated string that references an undefined variable will be treated as an empty string. For example, “\\(bogus)”. References to undefined variables as arguments to function calls, such as “\\(f(bogus))”, are still errors." = "插值字符串中的未定义变量按空字符串处理。\n例如 \\(bogus)；函数参数中的未定义变量（如 \\(f(bogus))）仍会报错。";
"Should references to undefined variables in interpolated strings be converted to empty string?" = "插值字符串中的未定义变量按空字符串处理。";
"Set ITERM2_COOKIE environment variable, allowing Python scripts to be launched without confirmation?\nThis will only affect sessions created after changing this setting." = "设置 ITERM2_COOKIE，允许 Python 脚本无需确认即可启动。\n仅影响更改后创建的会话。";
"Set ITERM2_COOKIE environment variable, allowing Python scripts to be launched without confirmation?" = "设置 ITERM2_COOKIE，允许 Python 脚本无需确认即可启动。";
"Set IT2_APP_PATH environment variable on new sessions, pointing at this iTerm2 build’s app bundle?\nThis disambiguates the AppleScript target when multiple iTerm2 builds with the same bundle identifier are running, so that the “it2” CLI requests its cookie from this iTerm2 instance. Intended for iTerm2 developers. Only affects sessions created after changing this setting." = "为新会话设置指向当前应用包的 IT2_APP_PATH。\n多个相同 Bundle ID 的构建同时运行时，帮助 it2 CLI 向正确实例请求 cookie；用于开发，仅影响新会话。";
"Set IT2_APP_PATH environment variable on new sessions, pointing at this iTerm2 build’s app bundle?" = "为新会话设置指向当前应用包的 IT2_APP_PATH。";

"Save windows, tabs, and split panes from Window > Save Window Arrangement. Select a layout below to preview it or set the default. To restore it at launch, choose Open Default Window Arrangement in Startup & Exit." = "通过“窗口 → 保存窗口布局”保存窗口、标签页和分屏。选择下方布局可预览或设为默认；若要启动时恢复，请在“启动与退出”中选择“打开默认窗口布局”。";
"Select a saved window layout to see its preview." = "选择已保存的窗口布局以查看预览。";
"Changes are saved when edited. Some settings require a restart. Check a box to enable a Boolean setting; enter numbers or text in the value field. Bold names indicate values changed from their defaults." = "更改会自动保存，部分设置需重启后生效。勾选复选框开启选项，输入框可编辑数字或文本。偏离默认值的设置名称会加粗显示。";
"Integer" = "整数";
"Number" = "数字";
"Type: %@ · Default: %@" = "类型：%@ · 默认值：%@";

"New window" = "新窗口";
"Focused window" = "聚焦窗口";
"Topmost session window" = "最前方的会话窗口";

