/* Expert settings: multiline declarations and filter. */
"Default tab bar height\nThis does not affect the minimal or compact themes. In macOS 26, the system standard height is used instead and this setting is ignored." = "默认标签栏高度\n不影响极简和紧凑主题。macOS 26 使用系统标准高度，因此会忽略此设置。";
"Add items to Recents (in the dock icon's menu) to reopen recently used profiles as tabs?" = "在程序坞图标菜单的“最近使用”中添加项目，以便将最近使用的配置重新打开为标签页？";
"Color of source pane fill when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "移动或交换分屏时，源分屏的填充颜色。\n使用网页颜色格式 #rrggbb；也可使用 p3#rrggbb 指定 P3 色彩空间。";
"Color of source pane outer border when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "移动或交换分屏时，源分屏的外边框颜色。\n使用网页颜色格式 #rrggbb；也可使用 p3#rrggbb 指定 P3 色彩空间。";
"Color of source pane inner border when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "移动或交换分屏时，源分屏的内边框颜色。\n使用网页颜色格式 #rrggbb；也可使用 p3#rrggbb 指定 P3 色彩空间。";
"Color of drop target fill when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "拖动分屏时，放置目标的填充颜色。\n使用网页颜色格式 #rrggbb；也可使用 p3#rrggbb 指定 P3 色彩空间。";
"Color of drop target outer border when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "拖动分屏时，放置目标的外边框颜色。\n使用网页颜色格式 #rrggbb；也可使用 p3#rrggbb 指定 P3 色彩空间。";
"Color of drop target inner border when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "拖动分屏时，放置目标的内边框颜色。\n使用网页颜色格式 #rrggbb；也可使用 p3#rrggbb 指定 P3 色彩空间。";
"Scroll wheel up sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\e for escape." = "在备用屏幕模式下，向上滚动滚轮时发送指定文本。\n使用 Vim 转义语法，例如用 \\e 表示 Escape。";
"Scroll wheel down sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\e for escape." = "在备用屏幕模式下，向下滚动滚轮时发送指定文本。\n使用 Vim 转义语法，例如用 \\e 表示 Escape。";
"Regular expression for “Find URLs” command." = "“查找 URL”命令使用的正则表达式。";
"Warn if the `open` command appears to fail when secure keyboard input is enabled?" = "启用安全键盘输入时，若 open 命令似乎执行失败，是否发出警告？";
"When files are dropped into a terminal window, execute a silent coprocess.\nThis is an interpolated string. Use \\(filenames) to reference the shell-quoted, space-delimited full paths to the dropped files. If this preference is empty, the filenames get pasted instead." = "将文件拖入终端窗口时，执行静默协同进程。\n此值为插值字符串。使用 \\(filenames) 引用拖入文件的完整路径，路径会经过 shell 引号转义并以空格分隔。留空则直接粘贴文件名。";
"Hide stuck tooltips.\nWhen you hide Latterm using a hotkey while a tooltip is fading out it gets stuck because of an OS bug. Work around it with a nasty hack by enabling this feature." = "隐藏卡住的工具提示。\n使用热键隐藏 Latterm 时，正在淡出的工具提示可能因系统问题而停留在屏幕上。启用此变通措施可隐藏它。";
"Rate limit for Alert triggers.\nIf the same trigger fires with less than this time interval (in seconds) between firings, it will be suppressed." = "警告触发器的最短触发间隔（秒）。\n同一触发器在此间隔内再次触发时将被忽略。";
"Rate limit for Notification triggers.\nIf the same trigger fires with less than this time interval (in seconds) between firings, it will be suppressed." = "通知触发器的最短触发间隔（秒）。\n同一触发器在此间隔内再次触发时将被忽略。";
"Show buttons at the top of a selected command?\nWhen you select a command by single clicking the command line or its output, buttons are shown on the top right with options like Copy and Share. Note that this setting only applies when marks are not “line style” such as when using Auto Composer." = "在选中的命令上方显示操作按钮？\n单击命令行或其输出以选中命令时，在右上角显示复制、共享等按钮。此设置仅适用于非“线条样式”的标记，例如使用自动撰写器时。";
"Only consider a two+ part domain-name to be a URL if it also contains a slash.\nThis setting is used when guessing if a string is a URL for semantic history. When enabled, `example.com` would not be considered a URL but `example.com/` would be." = "仅当包含斜杠时，才将由两部分或更多部分组成的域名识别为 URL。\n此设置用于语义历史的 URL 推断。启用后，example.com 不会被识别为 URL，而 example.com/ 会。";
"Format for automatic session log filenames.\nSee the Badges documentation for supported substitutions." = "自动会话日志的文件名格式。\n支持的替换变量见徽标文档。";
"When restoring a window arrangement, ensure windows are entirely within the bounds of the current displays." = "恢复窗口布局时，确保窗口完全位于当前显示器的范围内。";
"Opaque windows have a border only in light mode.\nThis setting modifies “Show border around windows”. Borders in opaque windows in dark mode are ugly and the OS draws one that is pretty serviceable. Enable this if you have trouble seeing them." = "仅在浅色模式下为不透明窗口显示边框。\n此设置会调整“显示窗口边框”的行为。深色模式下，不透明窗口可使用系统绘制的边框；若边框难以辨认，可启用此项。";
"Suppress the notification that a saved arrangement has a bad initial working directory." = "不再提示已保存布局中的初始工作目录无效。";
"Delay in seconds between chunks when pasting normally." = "普通粘贴时，各文本块之间的延迟（秒）。";
"Separator inserted between multiple clippings when sending or copying them.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\n for newline and \\e for escape." = "发送或复制多条剪贴内容时，在条目之间插入的分隔符。\n使用 Vim 转义语法，例如用 \\n 表示换行、\\e 表示 Escape。";
"Delay in seconds before the Return that submits an auto-sent code review.\nWhen the code-review workgroup toolbar auto-sends review results to the main session, it pastes the results and then sends a Return to submit them. This is how long it waits, after the pasted results finish, before sending that Return. A paste-debouncing TUI (such as Claude Code) processes a paste and a Return that arrive together as one batch, so the Return can be swallowed and the review never submits; the delay makes the Return land in a later read so it submits. The default matches Claude Code’s 500 ms paste-settling window. Set to 0 to send it immediately." = "自动发送代码审查结果后，发送提交用 Return 键之前的延迟（秒）。\n代码审查工作组工具栏会先将结果粘贴到主会话，再发送 Return 提交。此设置控制粘贴结束后的等待时间。Claude Code 等会合并粘贴输入的终端应用，可能把紧随粘贴的 Return 一并处理，导致未能提交。延迟可使 Return 在下一批输入中单独到达。默认值对应 Claude Code 的 500 毫秒粘贴等待时间；设为 0 则立即发送。";
"Should Advanced Paste automatically enable “Wait for shell prompt before pasting each line” by default when prompt metadata is available?" = "提供了提示符元数据时，高级粘贴是否默认启用“粘贴每一行前等待 shell 提示符”？";
